window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":3,"en":"Climate Change & Adaptation","zh":"氣候變遷與調適","items":[{"w":"climate","pos":"n.","def":"the usual weather of a place over many years","cn":"氣候","s":"Taiwan has a warm and wet ________, so many visitors from Europe find the summer months hard to handle at first.","zh":"台灣擁有溫暖潮濕的氣候,所以許多來自歐洲的遊客一開始會覺得夏季幾個月很難適應。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A1","t":"氣候"},{"w":"atmosphere","pos":"n.","def":"the layer of gases around the Earth","cn":"大氣層","s":"Scientists explained that the ________ works like a warm blanket around the Earth, but too much carbon makes the blanket thicker.","zh":"科學家解釋說,大氣層就像包覆地球的一條溫暖毯子,但太多的碳會讓這條毯子變得更厚。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A2","t":"大氣層"},{"w":"atmospheric","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the air around the Earth","cn":"大氣的","s":"The research team measures ________ pressure every hour, because sudden changes often tell them that a storm is coming.","zh":"研究團隊每小時測量一次大氣壓力,因為突然的變化常常告訴他們暴風雨即將來臨。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A3","t":"大氣"},{"w":"temperature","pos":"n.","def":"how hot or cold something is","cn":"溫度;氣溫","s":"The average ________ in Taipei has risen over the past fifty years, and many older residents say summers feel much longer now.","zh":"台北的平均氣溫在過去五十年間上升了,許多年長居民說現在的夏天感覺長了許多。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A4","t":"氣溫"},{"w":"humidity","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of water in the air","cn":"濕度","s":"The ________ was over ninety percent this afternoon, so my clothes would not dry and the whole apartment felt sticky.","zh":"今天下午的濕度超過百分之九十,所以我的衣服乾不了,整間公寓都感覺黏黏的。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A5","t":"濕度"},{"w":"humid","pos":"adj.","def":"hot and wet in an uncomfortable way","cn":"潮濕悶熱的","s":"July in southern Taiwan is extremely hot and ________, so we always carry a towel and plenty of water when we go out.","zh":"南台灣的七月非常炎熱又潮濕悶熱,所以我們出門時總是帶著毛巾和充足的水。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A6","t":"潮濕悶熱"},{"w":"precipitation","pos":"n.","def":"rain, snow or hail that falls from the sky","cn":"降水(量)","s":"Climate models show that ________ will become less regular, so some months may be very dry while others bring heavy rain.","zh":"氣候模型顯示降水將變得較不規律,因此有些月份可能非常乾燥,而另一些月份則會帶來大雨。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A7","t":"降水"},{"w":"rainfall","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of rain that falls in a place","cn":"降雨量","s":"Farmers in the area depend on spring ________ for their rice fields, but last year the rain arrived almost a month late.","zh":"這地區的農夫依賴春季降雨量來灌溉稻田,但去年雨水幾乎晚了一個月才來。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A8","t":"降雨量"},{"w":"evaporate","pos":"v.","def":"to change from liquid into gas","cn":"蒸發","s":"During the heatwave, the water in the small pond began to ________ quickly, and the frogs had to look for a new home.","zh":"熱浪期間,小池塘裡的水開始迅速蒸發,青蛙們只好去找新的家。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A9","t":"蒸發"},{"w":"evaporation","pos":"n.","def":"the process of water turning into gas","cn":"蒸發(作用)","s":"Higher temperatures increase ________ from lakes and soil, so reservoirs can lose water even when nobody is using it.","zh":"較高的氣溫會增加湖泊和土壤的蒸發,因此即使沒有人使用,水庫也可能流失水量。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A10","t":"蒸發"},{"w":"condensation","pos":"n.","def":"water drops that form when warm air touches something cold","cn":"凝結(水珠)","s":"There was a lot of ________ on the bathroom window this morning, because the hot shower filled the cold room with steam.","zh":"今天早上浴室窗戶上有很多凝結的水珠,因為熱水澡讓冰冷的房間充滿了蒸氣。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A11","t":"凝結的水珠"},{"w":"moisture","pos":"n.","def":"a small amount of water in the air or in something","cn":"濕氣;水分","s":"Warm air can hold more ________ than cold air, which is one reason why storms are becoming heavier in a warmer world.","zh":"暖空氣能比冷空氣容納更多水氣,這就是在更暖的世界裡暴風雨變得更猛烈的原因之一。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A12","t":"水氣"},{"w":"ozone","pos":"n.","def":"a gas high in the sky that blocks harmful sunlight","cn":"臭氧","s":"The layer of ________ high above us protects our skin from strong sunlight, and countries worked together to repair the hole in it.","zh":"我們頭頂高空中的臭氧層保護我們的皮膚免受強烈陽光傷害,各國也曾合作修補它的破洞。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A13","t":"臭氧"},{"w":"ultraviolet","pos":"adj.","def":"describing invisible light from the sun that can burn skin","cn":"紫外線的","s":"The weather app warned that ________ levels would be very high at noon, so the coach moved our practice to the evening.","zh":"天氣應用程式警告中午的紫外線指數會非常高,所以教練把我們的練習改到傍晚。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A14","t":"紫外線"},{"w":"radiation","pos":"n.","def":"energy that travels as heat or light","cn":"輻射","s":"The Earth receives ________ from the sun every day, and some of this energy should escape back into space at night.","zh":"地球每天接收來自太陽的輻射,而其中一部分能量應該在夜間散逸回太空。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A15","t":"輻射"},{"w":"solar","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the sun","cn":"太陽的","s":"Our school installed ________ lights along the path to the gym, and they charge during the day and shine all night.","zh":"我們學校在通往體育館的小路旁裝了太陽能燈,它們白天充電,整晚都會發光。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A16","t":"太陽能"},{"w":"meteorologist","pos":"n.","def":"a scientist who studies and reports the weather","cn":"氣象學家;氣象預報員","s":"The TV ________ said the typhoon would turn north, but many people still bought extra food and water just in case.","zh":"電視上的氣象預報員說颱風會轉向北方,但許多人還是買了額外的食物和水以防萬一。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A17","t":"氣象預報員"},{"w":"climatologist","pos":"n.","def":"a scientist who studies climate over long periods","cn":"氣候學家","s":"A ________ visited our class and showed us old temperature records, so we could see how much the island has warmed.","zh":"一位氣候學家來到我們班上,給我們看舊的氣溫紀錄,讓我們看見這座島已經變暖了多少。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A18","t":"氣候學家"},{"w":"thermometer","pos":"n.","def":"a tool that measures temperature","cn":"溫度計","s":"The ________ outside our classroom showed thirty-six degrees, so the principal let everyone stay inside during the break.","zh":"我們教室外的溫度計顯示三十六度,所以校長讓大家下課時都待在室內。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A19","t":"溫度計"},{"w":"Celsius","pos":"n.","def":"a scale for measuring temperature where water freezes at 0","cn":"攝氏","s":"World leaders hope to keep warming below 1.5 degrees ________, but many experts believe this goal is becoming very difficult.","zh":"世界領袖希望把暖化控制在攝氏1.5度以下,但許多專家認為這個目標正變得非常困難。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A20","t":"攝氏"},{"w":"anomaly","pos":"n.","def":"something that is different from what is normal","cn":"異常(現象)","s":"A warm winter used to be an ________ in this region, but now it happens almost every year and nobody is surprised.","zh":"暖冬過去在這個地區是一種異常現象,但現在幾乎每年都會發生,也沒有人感到驚訝了。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A21","t":"異常現象"},{"w":"seasonal","pos":"adj.","def":"happening at a particular time of the year","cn":"季節性的","s":"Many farmers hire ________ workers in the summer, but the harvest now starts earlier because the spring is warmer.","zh":"許多農夫在夏天雇用季節性工人,但因為春天變得較暖,收成現在提早開始了。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A22","t":"季節性"},{"w":"monsoon","pos":"n.","def":"the season of heavy rain in South and Southeast Asia","cn":"季風(雨季)","s":"The ________ brings most of the year's rain to India, so a weak season can hurt millions of farmers and their families.","zh":"季風為印度帶來一年中大部分的雨量,所以雨季偏弱時可能會傷害數百萬農民和他們的家庭。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A23","t":"季風"},{"w":"tropical","pos":"adj.","def":"from the hot area near the equator","cn":"熱帶的","s":"________ diseases such as dengue fever are spreading north, because mosquitoes can now survive in places that were once too cool.","zh":"像登革熱這樣的熱帶疾病正向北擴散,因為蚊子現在能在曾經太涼爽的地方存活。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A24","t":"熱帶"},{"w":"arid","pos":"adj.","def":"very dry with little rain","cn":"乾旱的;乾燥的","s":"The farm is in an ________ part of the country, so the family collects every drop of rain and grows plants that need little water.","zh":"這座農場位於國內乾旱的地區,所以這家人收集每一滴雨水,並種植需水量少的植物。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A25","t":"乾旱"},{"w":"temperate","pos":"adj.","def":"not very hot and not very cold","cn":"溫和的;溫帶的","s":"Britain has a ________ climate, but recent summers have been so hot that train tracks bent and some roads began to melt.","zh":"英國屬於溫帶氣候,但最近幾個夏天熱到鐵軌彎曲,有些道路也開始融化。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A26","t":"溫帶"},{"w":"polar","pos":"adj.","def":"near the North or South Pole","cn":"極地的","s":"________ regions are warming faster than the rest of the planet, and this change affects weather patterns far away.","zh":"極地地區暖化的速度比地球其他地方更快,而這種變化會影響遠方的天氣型態。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A27","t":"極地"},{"w":"latitude","pos":"n.","def":"the distance of a place north or south of the equator","cn":"緯度","s":"Some plants are moving to higher ________ as the climate warms, but slow-growing trees often cannot move fast enough.","zh":"隨著氣候變暖,有些植物正往較高緯度遷移,但生長緩慢的樹木往往移動得不夠快。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A28","t":"緯度"},{"w":"altitude","pos":"n.","def":"the height of a place above sea level","cn":"海拔;高度","s":"Tea farmers in Taiwan are planting at higher ________ now, because the lower hills have become too warm for good leaves.","zh":"台灣的茶農現在都種在更高的海拔,因為較低的山丘已經變得太熱,長不出好的茶葉。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A29","t":"海拔"},{"w":"jet stream","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a strong, fast wind high in the sky","cn":"噴射氣流","s":"When the ______ ______ gets weak and wavy, hot or cold weather can stay in one place for many days.","zh":"當噴射氣流變弱並呈波浪狀時,炎熱或寒冷的天氣可能會在同一個地方停留許多天。","part":"A","sec":"Climate Science & the Atmosphere 氣候科學與大氣","lab":"A30","t":"噴射氣流"},{"w":"greenhouse gas","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a gas that traps heat in the atmosphere","cn":"溫室氣體","s":"Carbon dioxide is the most common ______ ______, but methane from farms is also a serious problem.","zh":"二氧化碳是最常見的溫室氣體,但來自農場的甲烷也是一個嚴重的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A31","t":"溫室氣體"},{"w":"emission","pos":"n.","def":"gas or smoke that is sent into the air","cn":"排放(物)","s":"The city wants to cut its ________ by half before 2035, so it is adding more bus lanes and bike paths.","zh":"這座城市想在2035年前把排放量減半,所以正在增加更多公車專用道和自行車道。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A32","t":"排放量"},{"w":"emit","pos":"v.","def":"to send out gas, heat, light or sound","cn":"排放;散發","s":"Old motorcycles ________ much more smoke than new electric scooters, so the government gives money to people who replace them.","zh":"舊機車排放的廢氣比新的電動機車多得多,所以政府會補助汰換的民眾。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A33","t":"排放"},{"w":"carbon","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical element found in coal, oil and living things","cn":"碳","s":"Trees store ________ in their wood and leaves, so cutting down forests releases it back into the air.","zh":"樹木把碳儲存在木材和葉子裡,所以砍伐森林會把它釋放回空氣中。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A34","t":"碳"},{"w":"carbon dioxide","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the gas CO2, produced when fuel is burned","cn":"二氧化碳","s":"Every time we drive a petrol car, it releases ______ ______, and this gas stays in the air for hundreds of years.","zh":"每次我們開汽油車,它都會釋放二氧化碳,而這種氣體會在空氣中停留數百年。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A35","t":"二氧化碳"},{"w":"methane","pos":"n.","def":"a strong greenhouse gas from farms, rubbish and gas fields","cn":"甲烷","s":"Cows produce a lot of ________ when they digest grass, so some farmers are testing new kinds of animal food.","zh":"牛在消化草時會產生大量甲烷,所以有些農夫正在測試新型的動物飼料。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A36","t":"甲烷"},{"w":"fossil fuel","pos":"n.phr.","def":"coal, oil or gas formed from ancient plants and animals","cn":"化石燃料","s":"Most power plants still burn ______ ______, but the share of clean energy is growing every year.","zh":"大多數發電廠仍在燃燒化石燃料,但潔淨能源的比例每年都在成長。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A37","t":"化石燃料"},{"w":"coal","pos":"n.","def":"a hard black rock burned to make heat or electricity","cn":"煤","s":"The old power station burned ________ for forty years, but it will close next year and become a museum.","zh":"這座老舊發電廠燒煤燒了四十年,但它明年將關閉並改建為博物館。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A38","t":"煤"},{"w":"petroleum","pos":"n.","def":"oil from under the ground used to make fuel and plastic","cn":"石油","s":"Many everyday products are made from ________, so reducing plastic also helps to reduce our use of oil.","zh":"許多日常用品都是由石油製成的,所以減少塑膠也有助於減少我們對石油的使用。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A39","t":"石油"},{"w":"exhaust","pos":"n.","def":"waste gas that comes out of an engine","cn":"(引擎)廢氣","s":"The ________ from the buses made the air near the station dirty, so the city switched to electric buses last year.","zh":"公車排出的廢氣讓車站附近的空氣很髒,所以市政府去年改用電動公車。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A40","t":"廢氣"},{"w":"fumes","pos":"n.","def":"strong, unpleasant smoke or gas","cn":"(有害的)煙霧;廢氣","s":"The ________ from the factory smelled terrible, so local parents asked the company to clean its chimneys.","zh":"工廠排出的煙霧聞起來很可怕,所以當地家長要求公司清理煙囪。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A41","t":"煙霧"},{"w":"smog","pos":"n.","def":"dirty air that looks like fog over a city","cn":"霧霾;煙霧","s":"Thick ________ covered the city for three days, so schools cancelled outdoor sports and many people wore masks.","zh":"濃厚的霧霾籠罩城市三天,所以學校取消了戶外運動,許多人也戴上口罩。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A42","t":"霧霾"},{"w":"soot","pos":"n.","def":"black powder made when something is burned","cn":"煤灰;煙灰","s":"Black ________ from wildfires lands on snow and ice, and the dark surface then melts faster in the sun.","zh":"野火產生的黑色煙灰落在雪和冰上,而深色的表面在陽光下就會融化得更快。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A43","t":"煙灰"},{"w":"combustion","pos":"n.","def":"the process of burning","cn":"燃燒","s":"Cars with ________ engines burn fuel to move, but electric cars use batteries and produce no smoke on the road.","zh":"使用燃燒式引擎的汽車靠燃燒燃料來行駛,但電動車使用電池,在路上不會產生廢氣。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A44","t":"燃燒"},{"w":"absorb","pos":"v.","def":"to take in something such as liquid, heat or gas","cn":"吸收","s":"The ocean can ________ a lot of heat, but warmer water then causes problems for fish and other sea life.","zh":"海洋能吸收大量的熱,但較暖的海水接著會為魚類和其他海洋生物帶來問題。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A45","t":"吸收"},{"w":"absorption","pos":"n.","def":"the process of taking something in","cn":"吸收(作用)","s":"Dark roofs increase the ________ of heat, so painting them white can keep a building several degrees cooler.","zh":"深色屋頂會增加熱的吸收,所以把它們漆成白色可以讓建築物涼爽好幾度。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A46","t":"吸收"},{"w":"heat-trapping","pos":"adj.","def":"keeping heat in and not letting it escape","cn":"吸熱的;困住熱能的","s":"These ________ gases act like the glass of a car in summer, and the temperature inside keeps rising.","zh":"這些困住熱能的氣體就像夏天汽車的玻璃,而裡面的溫度會不斷上升。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A47","t":"困住熱能的"},{"w":"smokestack","pos":"n.","def":"a tall chimney on a factory","cn":"(工廠)煙囪","s":"Grey smoke rose from the tall ________ all night, and the neighbours complained that their washing turned dirty.","zh":"灰色煙霧整夜從高高的煙囪冒出,鄰居抱怨他們晾的衣服都變髒了。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A48","t":"煙囪"},{"w":"tailpipe","pos":"n.","def":"the pipe at the back of a car where exhaust comes out","cn":"(汽車)排氣管","s":"Electric cars have no ________, but the electricity they use may still come from coal power stations.","zh":"電動車沒有排氣管,但它們使用的電力可能仍來自燃煤發電廠。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A49","t":"排氣管"},{"w":"landfill","pos":"n.","def":"a place where rubbish is buried in the ground","cn":"垃圾掩埋場","s":"Food waste in a ________ produces methane as it rots, so our town now collects kitchen scraps separately.","zh":"垃圾掩埋場裡的廚餘在腐爛時會產生甲烷,所以我們鎮上現在把廚餘分開收集。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A50","t":"垃圾掩埋場"},{"w":"fertiliser","pos":"n.","def":"a substance added to soil to help plants grow","cn":"肥料","s":"Too much ________ washes into rivers when it rains, and it also releases a gas that warms the planet.","zh":"下雨時過多的肥料會被沖進河川,而且它也會釋放一種使地球變暖的氣體。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A51","t":"肥料"},{"w":"refinery","pos":"n.","def":"a factory where oil is made into fuel","cn":"煉油廠","s":"The new ________ will create many jobs, but environmental groups worry about the extra pollution it will bring.","zh":"新的煉油廠將創造許多工作機會,但環保團體擔心它會帶來額外的污染。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A52","t":"煉油廠"},{"w":"pollute","pos":"v.","def":"to make air, water or land dirty","cn":"污染","s":"Factories that ________ the river must now pay large fines, so many of them have started to clean their waste water.","zh":"污染河川的工廠現在必須繳納高額罰款,所以其中許多已開始處理它們的廢水。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A53","t":"污染"},{"w":"carbon sink","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a forest, ocean or soil that takes in more carbon than it gives out","cn":"碳匯","s":"The mangrove forest is an important ______ ______, so the village protects it and plants new trees every spring.","zh":"紅樹林是一個重要的碳匯,所以村民保護它,並在每年春天種植新樹。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A54","t":"碳匯"},{"w":"decarbonise","pos":"v.","def":"to reduce the carbon a country or company produces","cn":"去碳化;減碳","s":"The steel company promised to ________ its factories by 2050, but critics say the plan has no clear steps.","zh":"這家鋼鐵公司承諾在2050年前讓工廠去碳化,但批評者說這個計畫沒有明確的步驟。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A55","t":"去碳化"},{"w":"aerosol","pos":"n.","def":"tiny drops or bits floating in the air","cn":"氣溶膠;懸浮微粒","s":"Some ________ from volcanoes can cool the planet for a short time, but they do not solve the problem of global warming.","zh":"某些來自火山的懸浮微粒能讓地球短暫降溫,但它們無法解決全球暖化的問題。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A56","t":"懸浮微粒"},{"w":"incinerate","pos":"v.","def":"to burn something completely, especially rubbish","cn":"焚化","s":"Many cities ________ their rubbish to save space, but burning plastic releases carbon and other harmful gases.","zh":"許多城市焚化垃圾以節省空間,但燃燒塑膠會釋放碳和其他有害氣體。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A57","t":"焚化"},{"w":"industrialised","pos":"adj.","def":"having many factories and industries","cn":"工業化的","s":"________ countries have produced most of the carbon in the past, so poorer nations say the rich should pay more for solutions.","zh":"工業化國家過去製造了大部分的碳,所以較貧窮的國家說富國應該為解決方案付出更多。","part":"A","sec":"Greenhouse Gases & Emissions 溫室氣體與排放","lab":"A58","t":"工業化"},{"w":"sweltering","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely hot and uncomfortable","cn":"酷熱難耐的","s":"It was a ________ afternoon at the bus stop, and an old man nearly fainted before the bus finally arrived.","zh":"公車站那天下午酷熱難耐,一位老先生在公車終於到站前差點昏倒。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A59","t":"酷熱難耐"},{"w":"heatwave","pos":"n.","def":"a period of unusually hot weather","cn":"熱浪","s":"During the ________ last August, hospitals were full of elderly patients, so the city opened cool rooms in libraries.","zh":"去年八月的熱浪期間,醫院擠滿了年長的病人,所以市政府在圖書館開設了降溫室。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A60","t":"熱浪"},{"w":"typhoon","pos":"n.","def":"a violent tropical storm in the western Pacific","cn":"颱風","s":"Schools were closed because a strong ________ was approaching, but my little brother was disappointed that it only rained a little.","zh":"因為一個強烈颱風正在接近,學校停課了,但我弟弟很失望因為只下了一點雨。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A61","t":"颱風"},{"w":"hurricane","pos":"n.","def":"a violent tropical storm in the Atlantic","cn":"颶風","s":"The ________ destroyed hundreds of homes in Florida, and many families had to live in hotels for months.","zh":"颶風摧毀了佛羅里達州數百棟房屋,許多家庭不得不在旅館住上好幾個月。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A62","t":"颶風"},{"w":"cyclone","pos":"n.","def":"a violent storm with strong circular winds","cn":"氣旋;熱帶風暴","s":"A powerful ________ hit the coast of Bangladesh, but early warnings helped thousands of people reach safety in time.","zh":"一個強大的氣旋襲擊了孟加拉沿岸,但及早的警報幫助數千人及時抵達安全處。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A63","t":"氣旋"},{"w":"tornado","pos":"n.","def":"a narrow, spinning column of wind that destroys things","cn":"龍捲風","s":"The ________ lifted cars into the air, yet the family survived because they hid in the basement.","zh":"龍捲風把汽車捲到空中,但這家人因為躲在地下室而倖存。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A64","t":"龍捲風"},{"w":"storm surge","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sudden rise of sea water pushed by a storm","cn":"風暴潮","s":"The ______ ______ pushed seawater two metres into the streets, so many ground-floor shops were completely ruined.","zh":"風暴潮把海水推進街道達兩公尺高,所以許多一樓的店家完全被毀。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A65","t":"風暴潮"},{"w":"flood","pos":"v.","def":"to cover an area with water","cn":"淹沒;淹水","s":"Heavy rain ________ the underground car park, and dozens of cars were stuck under the water until the next day.","zh":"大雨淹沒了地下停車場,數十輛汽車被困在水下直到隔天。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A66","t":"淹沒"},{"w":"downpour","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden heavy fall of rain","cn":"傾盆大雨","s":"We were caught in a sudden ________ on the way home, and our school bags were completely soaked.","zh":"我們在回家的路上遇到一場突如其來的傾盆大雨,書包全都濕透了。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A67","t":"傾盆大雨"},{"w":"torrential","pos":"adj.","def":"used to describe very heavy rain","cn":"(雨)傾盆的;猛烈的","s":"________ rain fell for twelve hours, so the river rose quickly and the bridge had to be closed.","zh":"傾盆大雨下了十二個小時,所以河水迅速上漲,橋也不得不封閉。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A68","t":"傾盆"},{"w":"landslide","pos":"n.","def":"a mass of earth and rocks falling down a hill","cn":"山崩;土石流","s":"A ________ blocked the mountain road after the typhoon, and the villagers had no fresh food for a week.","zh":"颱風過後一場山崩堵住了山路,村民們一週都沒有新鮮的食物。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A69","t":"山崩"},{"w":"mudslide","pos":"n.","def":"a flow of wet mud down a hill","cn":"泥流;土石流","s":"The hillside had lost its trees, so the heavy rain caused a ________ that buried several houses.","zh":"山坡的樹木已經沒了,所以大雨引發了一場土石流,掩埋了好幾棟房子。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A70","t":"土石流"},{"w":"avalanche","pos":"n.","def":"a large amount of snow falling down a mountain","cn":"雪崩","s":"Warmer winters make the snow less stable, so the risk of an ________ is higher for skiers in spring.","zh":"較暖的冬天讓積雪較不穩定,所以春季滑雪者遇到雪崩的風險更高。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A71","t":"雪崩"},{"w":"blizzard","pos":"n.","def":"a severe snowstorm with strong wind","cn":"暴風雪","s":"The ________ closed the airport for two days, and thousands of travellers slept on the floor of the terminal.","zh":"暴風雪讓機場關閉了兩天,數千名旅客睡在航廈的地板上。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A72","t":"暴風雪"},{"w":"hailstorm","pos":"n.","def":"a storm in which balls of ice fall from the sky","cn":"冰雹暴","s":"A sudden ________ damaged the fruit on the trees, so the farmer lost almost half of his apples.","zh":"一場突如其來的冰雹打壞了樹上的果實,所以這位農夫損失了將近一半的蘋果。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A73","t":"冰雹"},{"w":"lightning","pos":"n.","def":"a bright flash of electricity in the sky during a storm","cn":"閃電","s":"________ struck a tree near the playground, so the teacher told all the students to go inside at once.","zh":"閃電擊中了遊樂場附近的一棵樹,所以老師叫所有學生立刻進到室內。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A74","t":"閃電"},{"w":"thunderstorm","pos":"n.","def":"a storm with thunder, lightning and heavy rain","cn":"雷雨","s":"Afternoon ________ are common in Taipei in summer, so I always keep an umbrella in my backpack.","zh":"夏天的台北常有午後雷雨,所以我總是在背包裡放一把傘。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A75","t":"雷雨"},{"w":"gust","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden strong rush of wind","cn":"一陣強風","s":"A strong ________ of wind turned my umbrella inside out, and everyone at the bus stop started laughing.","zh":"一陣強風把我的傘吹得翻了過來,公車站的每個人都笑了起來。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A76","t":"陣強風"},{"w":"evacuate","pos":"v.","def":"to move people away from a dangerous place","cn":"撤離;疏散","s":"Officials decided to ________ the coastal village before the storm arrived, but some old fishermen refused to leave.","zh":"官員決定在暴風雨來臨前撤離沿海村莊,但有些老漁夫拒絕離開。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A77","t":"撤離"},{"w":"evacuation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of moving people to a safe place","cn":"撤離;疏散","s":"The school practises an ________ plan twice a year, so every student knows which exit to use in an emergency.","zh":"學校每年演練兩次疏散計畫,所以每位學生都知道緊急時要走哪個出口。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A78","t":"疏散"},{"w":"shelter","pos":"n.","def":"a place that protects people from danger or bad weather","cn":"避難所","s":"The town turned the sports centre into a ________, and volunteers gave out blankets and hot meals all night.","zh":"鎮上把運動中心改成避難所,志工們整晚發放毛毯和熱食。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A79","t":"避難所"},{"w":"casualty","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is hurt or killed in an accident or disaster","cn":"傷亡者","s":"The storm was very strong, but there were few ________ because people had left the area in time.","zh":"暴風雨非常強烈,但由於人們及時離開了該地區,傷亡人數很少。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A80","t":"傷亡"},{"w":"disaster","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden event that causes great damage","cn":"災難","s":"The flood was the worst ________ in the town's history, and it took three years to rebuild the main street.","zh":"這場洪水是鎮上有史以來最嚴重的災難,重建主要街道花了三年時間。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A81","t":"災難"},{"w":"catastrophic","pos":"adj.","def":"causing terrible damage","cn":"災難性的","s":"Scientists warn that warming of three degrees could have ________ effects, so they want governments to act now.","zh":"科學家警告升溫三度可能帶來災難性的影響,所以他們希望各國政府現在就採取行動。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A82","t":"災難性的"},{"w":"devastate","pos":"v.","def":"to destroy or damage something very badly","cn":"摧毀;使荒廢","s":"The wildfire ________ the small mountain town, but the residents promised to rebuild it together.","zh":"野火摧毀了這座山中小鎮,但居民們承諾要一起重建它。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A83","t":"摧毀"},{"w":"hazard","pos":"n.","def":"something that may be dangerous","cn":"危險;危害","s":"Fallen power lines are a serious ________ after a typhoon, so children should never touch anything on the ground.","zh":"颱風過後倒下的電線是嚴重的危險,所以孩子們絕不應該碰觸地上的任何東西。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A84","t":"危險"},{"w":"frequency","pos":"n.","def":"how often something happens","cn":"頻率","s":"The ________ of strong typhoons has increased in recent years, and insurance companies have raised their prices.","zh":"近年來強烈颱風的頻率增加了,保險公司也提高了保費。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A85","t":"頻率"},{"w":"severity","pos":"n.","def":"how serious or bad something is","cn":"嚴重程度","s":"Nobody expected the ________ of the flooding, so many families did not move their cars or furniture in time.","zh":"沒有人預料到淹水的嚴重程度,所以許多家庭沒有及時移走他們的車子或家具。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A86","t":"嚴重程度"},{"w":"heatstroke","pos":"n.","def":"a dangerous illness caused by too much heat","cn":"中暑","s":"Two runners suffered from ________ during the summer race, so the organisers moved the next event to early morning.","zh":"兩名跑者在夏季賽跑中中暑,所以主辦單位把下一場比賽改到清晨。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A87","t":"中暑"},{"w":"dry spell","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a period with no rain","cn":"乾旱期;久旱","s":"After a long ______ ______, the farmers were happy to see rain, but the hard ground could not absorb it.","zh":"經過長時間的乾旱期,農夫們很高興看到下雨,但乾硬的土地無法吸收雨水。","part":"A","sec":"Extreme Weather & Natural Hazards 極端天氣與自然災害","lab":"A88","t":"乾旱期"},{"w":"glacier","pos":"n.","def":"a large mass of ice that moves slowly down a mountain","cn":"冰河","s":"My grandparents visited the ________ forty years ago, and when we went there last summer it was much smaller.","zh":"我的祖父母四十年前造訪過那座冰河,而我們去年夏天去的時候它已經小了很多。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A89","t":"冰河"},{"w":"ice sheet","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a very large, thick layer of ice covering land","cn":"冰原;冰蓋","s":"The ______ ______ in Greenland is losing billions of tonnes of ice each year, and this water raises the sea.","zh":"格陵蘭的冰原每年流失數十億噸的冰,而這些水會使海平面上升。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A90","t":"冰原"},{"w":"iceberg","pos":"n.","def":"a huge piece of ice floating in the sea","cn":"冰山","s":"A giant ________ broke away from Antarctica last year, and it was bigger than the city of Taipei.","zh":"去年一座巨大的冰山從南極洲斷裂分離,它比台北市還要大。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A91","t":"冰山"},{"w":"permafrost","pos":"n.","def":"ground that stays frozen all year","cn":"永凍土","s":"As the ________ melts, roads and houses in northern Russia are sinking, and old gases escape into the air.","zh":"隨著永凍土融化,俄羅斯北部的道路和房屋正在下陷,古老的氣體也逸散到空氣中。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A92","t":"永凍土"},{"w":"thaw","pos":"v.","def":"to change from ice to water; to stop being frozen","cn":"解凍;融化","s":"The lake used to stay frozen until April, but now it starts to ________ in early March.","zh":"這座湖過去會一直結冰到四月,但現在三月初就開始解凍了。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A93","t":"解凍"},{"w":"melt","pos":"v.","def":"to change from solid to liquid because of heat","cn":"融化","s":"The snow on the mountain ________ earlier every year, so the river has less water in the dry summer months.","zh":"山上的雪每年都更早融化,所以河川在乾燥的夏季月份水量變少了。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A94","t":"融化"},{"w":"meltwater","pos":"n.","def":"water from melting snow or ice","cn":"融水;雪水","s":"Villages in the Himalayas depend on ________ from glaciers, but this supply may disappear within a few decades.","zh":"喜馬拉雅山區的村莊依賴冰河的融水,但這項水源可能在幾十年內消失。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A95","t":"融水"},{"w":"sea level","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the average height of the sea's surface","cn":"海平面","s":"The ______ ______ around this island has risen by about twenty centimetres, and high tides now reach the main road.","zh":"這座島周圍的海平面上升了約二十公分,現在漲潮時海水已經到達主要道路。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A96","t":"海平面"},{"w":"coastline","pos":"n.","def":"the land along the edge of the sea","cn":"海岸線","s":"Taiwan has a long and beautiful ________, but some beaches are disappearing because the sea is rising.","zh":"台灣擁有漫長而美麗的海岸線,但有些海灘正因海平面上升而消失。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A97","t":"海岸線"},{"w":"coastal","pos":"adj.","def":"on or near the sea coast","cn":"沿海的","s":"Many ________ cities are building higher walls, because storms push seawater further inland than before.","zh":"許多沿海城市正在建造更高的牆,因為暴風雨把海水推得比以前更深入內陸。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A98","t":"沿海"},{"w":"low-lying","pos":"adj.","def":"close to sea level","cn":"地勢低窪的","s":"The family sold their house in a ________ area, because the street flooded every time there was a heavy storm.","zh":"這家人賣掉了他們位在地勢低窪地區的房子,因為每次大暴雨街道都會淹水。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A99","t":"地勢低窪"},{"w":"submerge","pos":"v.","def":"to go or put completely under water","cn":"淹沒;沉入水中","s":"Some Pacific islands may be ________ by the end of the century, so their governments are already planning for the future.","zh":"一些太平洋島嶼可能在本世紀末被淹沒,所以它們的政府已經在為未來做規劃。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A100","t":"淹沒"},{"w":"inundate","pos":"v.","def":"to flood an area with water","cn":"淹沒;泛濫","s":"Seawater ________ the rice fields during the storm, and the salt made the soil useless for several years.","zh":"暴風雨期間海水淹沒了稻田,而鹽分讓土壤好幾年都無法使用。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A101","t":"淹沒"},{"w":"tide","pos":"n.","def":"the regular rise and fall of the sea","cn":"潮汐;潮水","s":"When the ________ is high and it rains heavily, the drains cannot empty, so the streets of the old town flood.","zh":"當潮水很高又下大雨時,排水溝無法排空,所以老城區的街道就會淹水。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A102","t":"潮水"},{"w":"tidal","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the rise and fall of the sea","cn":"潮汐的","s":"The ________ flat near our town is full of crabs and birds, but rising water may cover it completely one day.","zh":"我們鎮附近的潮間灘地充滿了螃蟹和鳥類,但上升的海水有一天可能會把它完全淹沒。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A103","t":"潮間"},{"w":"acidification","pos":"n.","def":"the process of becoming more acidic","cn":"酸化","s":"Ocean ________ makes it harder for shellfish to build their shells, so oyster farmers are very worried.","zh":"海洋酸化讓貝類更難形成外殼,所以牡蠣養殖戶非常擔心。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A104","t":"酸化"},{"w":"acidic","pos":"adj.","def":"containing acid; sour","cn":"酸性的","s":"The sea is becoming more ________ because it absorbs carbon dioxide, and this change harms tiny sea creatures.","zh":"海洋因為吸收二氧化碳而變得更酸,這種變化傷害了微小的海洋生物。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A105","t":"酸"},{"w":"bleaching","pos":"n.","def":"the loss of colour in coral when the water is too warm","cn":"(珊瑚)白化","s":"Divers in Kenting saw serious coral ________ last summer, because the sea temperature stayed high for weeks.","zh":"去年夏天潛水員在墾丁看到嚴重的珊瑚白化,因為海水溫度連續好幾週居高不下。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A106","t":"白化"},{"w":"current","pos":"n.","def":"a steady flow of water in one direction","cn":"洋流;水流","s":"Ocean ________ carry warm water around the world, and if they slow down, the weather in Europe could change.","zh":"洋流把溫暖的海水帶到世界各地,如果它們減緩,歐洲的天氣可能會改變。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A107","t":"洋流"},{"w":"Arctic","pos":"n.","def":"the area around the North Pole","cn":"北極地區","s":"The ________ is warming almost four times faster than the rest of the world, so polar bears are losing their hunting grounds.","zh":"北極地區暖化的速度幾乎是世界其他地方的四倍,所以北極熊正在失去牠們的獵食場。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A108","t":"北極地區"},{"w":"Antarctic","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the area around the South Pole","cn":"南極的","s":"Scientists live at ________ research stations for months, and they study the ice to learn about past climates.","zh":"科學家在南極研究站住上好幾個月,他們研究冰層以了解過去的氣候。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A109","t":"南極"},{"w":"ice cap","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a thick layer of ice covering a large area","cn":"冰帽;冰冠","s":"The polar ______ ______ reflect sunlight back into space, but as they shrink, the dark sea absorbs more heat.","zh":"極地冰帽會把陽光反射回太空,但當它們縮小時,深色的海洋就會吸收更多熱。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A110","t":"冰帽"},{"w":"salinity","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of salt in water","cn":"鹽度","s":"Melting ice lowers the ________ of the ocean, and this can change the way water moves around the planet.","zh":"融化的冰會降低海洋的鹽度,而這可能改變海水在地球上流動的方式。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A111","t":"鹽度"},{"w":"sea ice","pos":"n.phr.","def":"frozen sea water floating on the ocean","cn":"海冰","s":"Polar bears hunt seals on the ______ ______, but it now melts earlier in spring and forms later in autumn.","zh":"北極熊在海冰上獵捕海豹,但現在海冰春天融化得更早,秋天也更晚形成。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A112","t":"海冰"},{"w":"thermal expansion","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the way water takes up more space when it gets warmer","cn":"熱膨脹","s":"Part of sea level rise comes from ______ ______, because warm water takes up more space than cold water.","zh":"海平面上升有一部分來自熱膨脹,因為溫暖的水比冷水占據更多空間。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A113","t":"熱膨脹"},{"w":"delta","pos":"n.","def":"flat land where a river divides before entering the sea","cn":"三角洲","s":"Millions of people farm in the Mekong ________, but salty seawater is now reaching their rice fields.","zh":"數百萬人在湄公河三角洲務農,但鹹的海水現在已經流進他們的稻田。","part":"A","sec":"Oceans, Ice & Rising Seas 海洋、冰層與海平面上升","lab":"A114","t":"三角洲"},{"w":"famine","pos":"n.","def":"a serious lack of food in a large area","cn":"饑荒","s":"Years without rain led to ________ in parts of East Africa, so aid groups sent food and clean water.","zh":"多年不下雨導致東非部分地區發生饑荒,所以援助團體送去了食物和乾淨的水。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A115","t":"饑荒"},{"w":"scarcity","pos":"n.","def":"a situation in which there is not enough of something","cn":"缺乏;短缺","s":"Water ________ is a growing problem in many cities, and some families can only use tap water on certain days.","zh":"水資源短缺在許多城市是一個日益嚴重的問題,有些家庭只能在特定日子使用自來水。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A116","t":"短缺"},{"w":"water stress","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when people need more water than is available","cn":"缺水壓力;水資源壓力","s":"Regions under high ______ ______ must save every drop, so farmers there are switching to crops that need less water.","zh":"處於高度缺水壓力的地區必須節約每一滴水,所以那裡的農夫正改種需水量較少的作物。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A117","t":"缺水壓力"},{"w":"crop failure","pos":"n.phr.","def":"when crops do not grow well enough to harvest","cn":"作物歉收","s":"A ______ ______ can push food prices up quickly, and poor families then have to spend more on rice and vegetables.","zh":"作物歉收可能讓食物價格迅速上漲,而貧窮家庭就得花更多錢在米和蔬菜上。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A118","t":"作物歉收"},{"w":"yield","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of crops a farm produces","cn":"產量;收成","s":"The rice ________ fell sharply this year because of the heat, so the price of a bowl of rice went up.","zh":"由於高溫,今年稻米的產量大幅下降,所以一碗飯的價格上漲了。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A119","t":"產量"},{"w":"heat-related","pos":"adj.","def":"caused by very hot weather","cn":"與高溫相關的","s":"Doctors reported more ________ illnesses this summer, and most of the patients were outdoor workers or elderly people.","zh":"醫生回報今年夏天與高溫相關的疾病增加了,而大多數病人是戶外工作者或年長者。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A120","t":"與高溫相關的"},{"w":"malaria","pos":"n.","def":"a serious disease spread by mosquitoes","cn":"瘧疾","s":"________ used to be rare in the highlands of Kenya, but warmer weather now lets mosquitoes live there.","zh":"瘧疾過去在肯亞高地很少見,但較暖的天氣現在讓蚊子能在那裡生存。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A121","t":"瘧疾"},{"w":"mosquito","pos":"n.","def":"a small flying insect that bites people","cn":"蚊子","s":"Every summer the city sprays areas where ________ breed, because they can spread dengue fever.","zh":"每年夏天市政府都會在蚊子繁殖的地方噴藥,因為牠們會傳播登革熱。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A122","t":"蚊子"},{"w":"infectious","pos":"adj.","def":"able to spread from one person to another","cn":"傳染性的","s":"Floods can spread ________ diseases quickly, so health workers handed out clean water and medicine after the storm.","zh":"洪水可能讓傳染性疾病迅速擴散,所以暴風雨過後衛生人員發放了乾淨的水和藥品。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A123","t":"傳染性"},{"w":"refugee","pos":"n.","def":"a person forced to leave their home or country","cn":"難民","s":"Some experts believe that climate ________ will increase in the future, because rising seas and droughts make places unsafe.","zh":"一些專家認為氣候難民未來會增加,因為上升的海平面和乾旱讓一些地方變得不安全。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A124","t":"難民"},{"w":"displacement","pos":"n.","def":"the forced movement of people from their homes","cn":"流離失所;被迫遷移","s":"The floods caused the ________ of thousands of families, and many of them still live in temporary camps.","zh":"這場洪水造成數千個家庭流離失所,其中許多人至今仍住在臨時營地。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A125","t":"流離失所"},{"w":"migrant","pos":"n.","def":"a person who moves to another place to find work or safety","cn":"移民;移工","s":"Many ________ left their dry farms and moved to the city, but finding a job there was not easy.","zh":"許多移民離開了他們乾旱的農地搬到城市,但在那裡找工作並不容易。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A126","t":"移民"},{"w":"homeless","pos":"adj.","def":"having no place to live","cn":"無家可歸的","s":"The typhoon left hundreds of people ________, so local temples opened their doors and offered free meals.","zh":"颱風讓數百人無家可歸,所以當地廟宇敞開大門並提供免費餐點。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A127","t":"無家可歸"},{"w":"property","pos":"n.","def":"buildings and land that someone owns","cn":"房地產;財產","s":"________ near the beach used to be very valuable, but buyers are now worried about flooding and rising seas.","zh":"海灘附近的房地產過去非常值錢,但買家現在擔心淹水和海平面上升。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A128","t":"房地產"},{"w":"insurance","pos":"n.","def":"an agreement to pay money if something is damaged or lost","cn":"保險","s":"After three floods in five years, the company refused to sell ________ to homeowners in that area.","zh":"五年內發生三次水災之後,這家公司拒絕賣保險給那個地區的屋主。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A129","t":"保險"},{"w":"premium","pos":"n.","def":"the amount paid regularly for insurance","cn":"保費","s":"Our home insurance ________ doubled this year, because the company now sees our street as a high-risk area.","zh":"我們的房屋保險保費今年翻倍了,因為保險公司現在把我們這條街視為高風險地區。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A130","t":"保費"},{"w":"damage","pos":"n.","def":"physical harm that makes something less useful or valuable","cn":"損害;損壞","s":"The storm caused serious ________ to the school roof, so classes moved to the library for two weeks.","zh":"暴風雨對學校屋頂造成了嚴重的損害,所以上課地點移到圖書館兩週。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A131","t":"損害"},{"w":"poverty","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being very poor","cn":"貧窮","s":"Climate change can push families into ________, because one bad harvest may take away a whole year's income.","zh":"氣候變遷可能把家庭推向貧窮,因為一次歉收就可能奪走一整年的收入。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A132","t":"貧窮"},{"w":"food security","pos":"n.phr.","def":"having enough safe, healthy food to eat","cn":"糧食安全","s":"Taiwan imports most of its wheat, so ______ ______ is an important topic when global harvests fail.","zh":"台灣大部分的小麥都靠進口,所以當全球收成不佳時,糧食安全是一個重要的議題。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A133","t":"糧食安全"},{"w":"malnourished","pos":"adj.","def":"weak or ill because of not eating enough healthy food","cn":"營養不良的","s":"After two failed harvests, many children in the village were ________, so a charity started a free lunch programme.","zh":"連續兩次歉收後,村裡許多孩子營養不良,所以一個慈善團體開始了免費午餐計畫。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A134","t":"營養不良"},{"w":"wither","pos":"v.","def":"to become dry and weak and start to die","cn":"枯萎","s":"The vegetables in our garden began to ________ in the heat, so my mother watered them twice a day.","zh":"我們菜園裡的蔬菜在高溫中開始枯萎,所以我媽媽一天澆兩次水。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A135","t":"枯萎"},{"w":"parched","pos":"adj.","def":"very dry because of no rain","cn":"乾裂的;焦乾的","s":"The fields were brown and ________ after months without rain, and the cows had little grass to eat.","zh":"幾個月沒下雨後,田地變得又黃又乾裂,牛群幾乎沒有草可吃。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A136","t":"乾裂"},{"w":"desertification","pos":"n.","def":"the process of land slowly becoming desert","cn":"沙漠化","s":"________ is spreading in northern China, so millions of trees have been planted to stop the sand.","zh":"沙漠化正在中國北方擴散,所以已經種了數百萬棵樹來阻擋沙子。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A137","t":"沙漠化"},{"w":"algae","pos":"n.","def":"very simple plants that grow in water","cn":"藻類","s":"Warm water caused ________ to grow quickly in the lake, and the fish died because there was not enough oxygen.","zh":"溫暖的水讓湖中的藻類迅速生長,魚群因為氧氣不足而死亡。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A138","t":"藻類"},{"w":"range","pos":"n.","def":"the area where a plant or animal lives","cn":"分布範圍","s":"The ________ of this butterfly has moved two hundred kilometres north, because its old home has become too warm.","zh":"這種蝴蝶的分布範圍已經向北移動了兩百公里,因為牠原本的家變得太熱了。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A139","t":"分布範圍"},{"w":"heat island","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a city area much warmer than the countryside around it","cn":"熱島","s":"The city centre is a ______ ______ in summer, because concrete and cars trap heat even at night.","zh":"市中心在夏天是一個熱島,因為混凝土和汽車即使在夜間也會困住熱能。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A140","t":"熱島"},{"w":"hardship","pos":"n.","def":"a difficult situation, often without enough money or food","cn":"苦難;困境","s":"The drought brought great ________ to farming families, but neighbours shared water and food to help each other.","zh":"乾旱為務農家庭帶來極大的困境,但鄰居們分享水和食物互相幫助。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A141","t":"困境"},{"w":"uninhabitable","pos":"adj.","def":"not safe or suitable for people to live in","cn":"不適合居住的","s":"Some scientists fear that parts of the Middle East could become ________ in summer, because the heat will be too extreme.","zh":"一些科學家擔心中東部分地區在夏天可能變得不適合居住,因為高溫將過於極端。","part":"A","sec":"Impacts on People & Nature 對人類與自然的影響","lab":"A142","t":"不適合居住"},{"w":"adaptation","pos":"n.","def":"a change made to deal with new conditions","cn":"調適;適應","s":"Climate ________ includes simple steps like planting trees for shade, so it is not only about expensive engineering.","zh":"氣候調適包括像種樹遮蔭這樣簡單的步驟,所以它不只是關於昂貴的工程。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A143","t":"調適"},{"w":"resilient","pos":"adj.","def":"able to recover quickly after something bad happens","cn":"有韌性的;能迅速復原的","s":"The new hospital was designed to be ________, so it can keep running even if the power goes out during a storm.","zh":"新醫院被設計得很有韌性,所以即使暴風雨中停電也能持續運作。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A144","t":"有韌性"},{"w":"seawall","pos":"n.","def":"a strong wall built to stop the sea from flooding land","cn":"海堤","s":"The town built a taller ________ along the beach, but some people say it ruined the view of the ocean.","zh":"鎮上沿著海灘建了一道更高的海堤,但有些人說它破壞了海景。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A145","t":"海堤"},{"w":"levee","pos":"n.","def":"a raised bank built beside a river to stop flooding","cn":"河堤;防洪堤","s":"The ________ along the river held back the water, so the neighbourhood stayed dry during the heavy rain.","zh":"沿著河邊的河堤擋住了河水,所以這個社區在大雨期間保持乾燥。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A146","t":"河堤"},{"w":"embankment","pos":"n.","def":"a wall of earth or stone that holds back water","cn":"堤防;路堤","s":"Volunteers filled sandbags to make the ________ higher, and they worked through the night before the river peaked.","zh":"志工們裝填沙包把堤防加高,他們在河水達到最高點前通宵工作。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A147","t":"堤防"},{"w":"floodgate","pos":"n.","def":"a gate that controls the flow of water","cn":"水閘門","s":"Workers closed the ________ before the typhoon arrived, so the seawater could not flow into the canal.","zh":"工人在颱風來臨前關閉了水閘門,所以海水無法流進運河。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A148","t":"水閘門"},{"w":"drainage","pos":"n.","def":"the system that carries away extra water","cn":"排水(系統)","s":"The old ________ system cannot handle today's heavy rain, so the city is digging wider pipes under the streets.","zh":"舊的排水系統無法應付現今的大雨,所以市政府正在街道下方挖設更寬的管線。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A149","t":"排水"},{"w":"reservoir","pos":"n.","def":"a large lake used to store water","cn":"水庫","s":"The water in the ________ dropped to ten percent, so the government asked everyone to take shorter showers.","zh":"水庫的水位降到百分之十,所以政府要求大家縮短淋浴時間。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A150","t":"水庫"},{"w":"irrigation","pos":"n.","def":"supplying water to land so crops can grow","cn":"灌溉","s":"Drip ________ gives water directly to plant roots, so farmers can grow food while using much less water.","zh":"滴水灌溉直接把水送到植物根部,所以農夫可以用少得多的水種出糧食。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A151","t":"灌溉"},{"w":"irrigate","pos":"v.","def":"to supply water to land through pipes or channels","cn":"灌溉","s":"The farmers ________ their fields at night now, because less water evaporates when the sun is down.","zh":"農夫們現在在夜間灌溉田地,因為太陽下山後蒸發的水較少。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A152","t":"灌溉"},{"w":"drought-resistant","pos":"adj.","def":"able to grow well with little water","cn":"耐旱的","s":"Scientists developed ________ rice, so farmers can still get a harvest when the rains come late.","zh":"科學家研發出耐旱稻米,所以即使雨水來得晚,農夫仍然可以有收成。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A153","t":"耐旱"},{"w":"early warning system","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a system that tells people about danger before it arrives","cn":"預警系統","s":"The new ______ ______ ______ sends text messages before floods, so families have time to move to higher ground.","zh":"新的預警系統會在淹水前發送簡訊,讓家庭有時間移往地勢較高處。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A154","t":"預警系統"},{"w":"elevate","pos":"v.","def":"to raise something to a higher position","cn":"抬高;架高","s":"Many families ________ their houses on concrete posts, so floodwater can pass underneath without entering the rooms.","zh":"許多家庭把房子架高在混凝土柱上,讓洪水可以從下方流過而不會進到房間。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A155","t":"架高"},{"w":"stilts","pos":"n.","def":"tall posts that hold a building above the ground or water","cn":"高腳柱;支柱","s":"The fishermen's houses stand on ________ above the water, so they stay safe when the tide is unusually high.","zh":"漁民的房子立在水面上的高腳柱上,所以即使潮水異常高漲也能保持安全。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A156","t":"高腳柱"},{"w":"rainwater","pos":"n.","def":"water that has fallen as rain","cn":"雨水","s":"Our school collects ________ from the roof in large tanks, and we use it to water the garden and flush toilets.","zh":"我們學校用大水塔收集屋頂的雨水,用來澆花和沖馬桶。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A157","t":"雨水"},{"w":"desalination","pos":"n.","def":"the process of removing salt from sea water","cn":"海水淡化","s":"The island built a ________ plant because its wells were drying up, but the drinking water is now more expensive.","zh":"這座島建了一座海水淡化廠,因為島上的水井快要乾涸,但飲用水現在變得更貴了。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A158","t":"海水淡化"},{"w":"shade","pos":"n.","def":"an area that is darker and cooler because the sun cannot reach it","cn":"陰涼處;遮蔭","s":"The city planted trees along the bus stops, so passengers can wait in the ________ on hot afternoons.","zh":"市政府在公車站旁種了樹,讓乘客在炎熱的下午可以在陰涼處等車。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A159","t":"陰涼處"},{"w":"reforestation","pos":"n.","def":"planting trees in an area where forests were cut down","cn":"重新造林","s":"The ________ project has planted a million trees, and the hills now hold rainwater instead of sliding down.","zh":"這項重新造林計畫已種下一百萬棵樹,現在山丘能留住雨水而不會崩塌。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A160","t":"重新造林"},{"w":"replant","pos":"v.","def":"to plant again","cn":"重新種植;補種","s":"After the fire, students helped ________ young trees on the hill, and they return every year to check them.","zh":"火災之後,學生們幫忙在山坡上補種小樹,而且他們每年都會回去查看。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A161","t":"補種"},{"w":"green roof","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a roof covered with plants","cn":"綠屋頂","s":"Our library has a ______ ______ full of plants, so the building stays cooler and absorbs heavy rain.","zh":"我們的圖書館有一座長滿植物的綠屋頂,所以建築物保持較涼爽,也能吸收大雨。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A162","t":"綠屋頂"},{"w":"ventilation","pos":"n.","def":"the movement of fresh air through a room or building","cn":"通風","s":"Good ________ keeps classrooms cooler without air-conditioning, so the new school has large windows on both sides.","zh":"良好的通風能讓教室在不開冷氣的情況下保持涼爽,所以新學校兩側都有大窗戶。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A163","t":"通風"},{"w":"air-conditioning","pos":"n.","def":"a system that keeps the air in a building cool","cn":"空調;冷氣","s":"Many families cannot afford ________, so heatwaves are especially dangerous for poor and elderly people.","zh":"許多家庭負擔不起冷氣,所以熱浪對貧窮和年長者特別危險。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A164","t":"冷氣"},{"w":"cooling centre","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a public place where people can escape extreme heat","cn":"避暑中心;降溫中心","s":"The library became a ______ ______ during the heatwave, and older residents spent the afternoon there reading newspapers.","zh":"熱浪期間圖書館成了避暑中心,年長居民在那裡看報紙度過下午。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A165","t":"避暑中心"},{"w":"preparedness","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being ready for an emergency","cn":"準備就緒;防備","s":"Disaster ________ starts at home, so every family should have a bag with water, a torch and medicine.","zh":"災害防備從家裡開始,所以每個家庭都應該準備一個裝有水、手電筒和藥品的包包。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A166","t":"防備"},{"w":"contingency plan","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a plan for what to do if something goes wrong","cn":"應變計畫","s":"The festival organisers had a ______ ______ for bad weather, so the concert moved indoors when the storm came.","zh":"活動主辦單位有針對惡劣天氣的應變計畫,所以暴風雨來時音樂會就移到室內舉行。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A167","t":"應變計畫"},{"w":"retrofit","pos":"v.","def":"to add new parts to an old building or machine","cn":"翻修改裝;加裝","s":"The city will ________ old apartment buildings with better insulation, so residents can stay cool and pay less for electricity.","zh":"市政府將為老舊公寓大樓加裝更好的隔熱設備,讓居民可以保持涼爽並少付電費。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A168","t":"加裝"},{"w":"flood-prone","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to flood","cn":"易淹水的","s":"New homes should not be built in ________ areas, but land there is cheap, so developers keep building.","zh":"新房子不應該蓋在易淹水的地區,但那裡的土地便宜,所以開發商一直在蓋。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A169","t":"易淹水的"},{"w":"zoning","pos":"n.","def":"rules about how land in an area may be used","cn":"土地分區管制","s":"The new ________ rules stop building near the river, and the land will become a park that can safely flood.","zh":"新的土地分區規定禁止在河邊建房,這塊地將變成一座可以安全淹水的公園。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A170","t":"土地分區"},{"w":"managed retreat","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a planned move of people away from dangerous coastal areas","cn":"有計畫的撤退(遷移)","s":"The village chose ______ ______ instead of building a huge wall, so the families moved inland with government help.","zh":"這個村莊選擇了有計畫的撤退,而不是建造巨大的牆,所以這些家庭在政府協助下遷往內陸。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A171","t":"有計畫的撤退"},{"w":"stockpile","pos":"v.","def":"to collect and store a large supply of something","cn":"儲備;囤積","s":"Before the typhoon season, the town ________ rice, water and medicine, so nobody went hungry when the roads closed.","zh":"颱風季前,鎮上儲備了米、水和藥品,所以道路封閉時沒有人挨餓。","part":"A","sec":"Adaptation & Resilience 調適與韌性","lab":"A172","t":"儲備"},{"w":"mitigation","pos":"n.","def":"actions that reduce how bad something is","cn":"減緩;緩解","s":"Climate ________ means cutting emissions, while adaptation means preparing for the changes that are already coming.","zh":"氣候減緩指的是減少排放,而調適則是為已經到來的變化做準備。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A173","t":"減緩"},{"w":"renewable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be replaced naturally, like sun and wind","cn":"可再生的","s":"Taiwan wants more ________ energy, so wind farms are being built off the west coast.","zh":"台灣希望有更多可再生能源,所以正在西部外海興建風場。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A174","t":"可再生"},{"w":"wind turbine","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a tall machine that uses wind to make electricity","cn":"風力發電機","s":"Each ______ ______ off the coast can power thousands of homes, but fishermen worry about losing their fishing areas.","zh":"外海的每一座風力發電機都能供應數千戶家庭用電,但漁民擔心失去他們的漁場。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A175","t":"風力發電機"},{"w":"solar panel","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a flat device that turns sunlight into electricity","cn":"太陽能板","s":"My uncle put ______ ______ on his roof, and now his electricity bill is almost zero in summer.","zh":"我叔叔在他家屋頂裝了太陽能板,現在他夏天的電費幾乎是零。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A176","t":"太陽能板"},{"w":"hydropower","pos":"n.","def":"electricity made from moving water","cn":"水力發電","s":"________ provides clean electricity, but dams can also flood valleys and change the life of a river.","zh":"水力發電提供潔淨的電力,但水壩也可能淹沒山谷並改變河流的生態。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A177","t":"水力發電"},{"w":"geothermal","pos":"adj.","def":"using heat from inside the Earth","cn":"地熱的","s":"Iceland uses ________ energy to heat most of its homes, because hot water lies just under the ground.","zh":"冰島使用地熱能源為大部分的住家供暖,因為熱水就在地底下不遠處。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A178","t":"地熱"},{"w":"biofuel","pos":"n.","def":"fuel made from plants or animal waste","cn":"生質燃料","s":"Some airlines are testing ________ made from used cooking oil, but there is not enough of it for every plane.","zh":"一些航空公司正在測試用廢食用油製成的生質燃料,但數量還不夠供應每架飛機。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A179","t":"生質燃料"},{"w":"electric vehicle","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a car or scooter that runs on a battery","cn":"電動車","s":"My father bought an ______ ______ last year, and he charges it at home every night after work.","zh":"我爸爸去年買了一輛電動車,他每天下班後晚上都在家充電。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A180","t":"電動車"},{"w":"battery","pos":"n.","def":"a device that stores electricity","cn":"電池","s":"Large ________ can store solar power during the day, so homes can still use clean energy at night.","zh":"大型電池可以在白天儲存太陽能,讓家庭在夜間仍然能使用潔淨能源。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A181","t":"電池"},{"w":"grid","pos":"n.","def":"the network of power lines that delivers electricity","cn":"電網","s":"The power ________ could not handle the demand during the heatwave, so some areas had blackouts in the evening.","zh":"熱浪期間電網無法負荷用電需求,所以有些地區在傍晚停電。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A182","t":"電網"},{"w":"insulation","pos":"n.","def":"material that stops heat from getting in or out","cn":"隔熱(材料)","s":"Good roof ________ keeps the top floor cooler in summer, so the family uses the air-conditioner much less.","zh":"良好的屋頂隔熱能讓頂樓在夏天保持涼爽,所以這家人使用冷氣的次數大幅減少。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A183","t":"隔熱"},{"w":"energy-efficient","pos":"adj.","def":"using less energy to do the same job","cn":"節能的","s":"We replaced our old fridge with an ________ model, and our monthly electricity bill dropped quite a lot.","zh":"我們把舊冰箱換成節能型號,每月的電費也下降了不少。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A184","t":"節能"},{"w":"recycle","pos":"v.","def":"to treat used things so they can be used again","cn":"回收","s":"Our class tries to ________ every bottle and can, and we use the money from the recycling centre for a class trip.","zh":"我們班盡量回收每一個瓶子和罐子,並用從回收中心換來的錢去校外旅行。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A185","t":"回收"},{"w":"carbon tax","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a charge on fuels that produce carbon","cn":"碳稅","s":"The government introduced a ______ ______ on big factories, so many companies started to look for cleaner ways to work.","zh":"政府對大型工廠開徵碳稅,所以許多公司開始尋找更乾淨的運作方式。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A186","t":"碳稅"},{"w":"pledge","pos":"n.","def":"a serious promise","cn":"承諾;保證","s":"Many countries made a ________ to reach net zero, but their actions so far are not enough to meet it.","zh":"許多國家做出了達到淨零的承諾,但它們到目前為止的行動還不足以實現它。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A187","t":"承諾"},{"w":"summit","pos":"n.","def":"an important meeting between leaders","cn":"高峰會","s":"World leaders met at the climate ________ in November, but they could not agree on how much money to give poorer nations.","zh":"世界領袖們在十一月的氣候高峰會上會面,但他們無法就該給較貧窮國家多少資金達成共識。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A188","t":"高峰會"},{"w":"delegate","pos":"n.","def":"a person sent to a meeting to represent others","cn":"代表","s":"The young ________ from a Pacific island gave an emotional speech, and many people in the room started crying.","zh":"來自一座太平洋島嶼的年輕代表發表了一場動人的演說,會場上許多人都哭了。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A189","t":"代表"},{"w":"accord","pos":"n.","def":"an official agreement between countries","cn":"協定;協議","s":"The Paris ________ was signed by almost every country, but each nation decides its own plan to cut emissions.","zh":"《巴黎協定》幾乎每個國家都簽署了,但每個國家自行決定減排計畫。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A190","t":"協定"},{"w":"commitment","pos":"n.","def":"a promise to do something","cn":"承諾;投入","s":"The company made a ________ to use only green electricity, so it signed a long contract with a wind farm.","zh":"這家公司承諾只使用綠電,所以它與一座風場簽訂了長期合約。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A191","t":"承諾"},{"w":"ratify","pos":"v.","def":"to make an agreement official by signing or voting","cn":"正式批准","s":"Parliament voted to ________ the climate agreement, and the new law will start next January.","zh":"國會投票正式批准這項氣候協議,新法將於明年一月開始實施。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A192","t":"正式批准"},{"w":"carbon-neutral","pos":"adj.","def":"adding no extra carbon to the atmosphere overall","cn":"碳中和的","s":"Our school wants to become ________ by 2030, so we are planting trees and putting solar panels on the gym.","zh":"我們學校希望在2030年前達到碳中和,所以我們正在種樹並在體育館上裝設太陽能板。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A193","t":"碳中和"},{"w":"nuclear","pos":"adj.","def":"using energy from splitting atoms","cn":"核能的","s":"________ power produces very little carbon, but many people worry about accidents and how to store the waste.","zh":"核能發電產生的碳非常少,但許多人擔心意外事故以及如何貯存廢料。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A194","t":"核能"},{"w":"activist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works to bring political or social change","cn":"社運人士;行動者","s":"The young climate ________ spoke at the United Nations, and her speech inspired students in many countries.","zh":"這位年輕的氣候行動者在聯合國發表演說,她的演講激勵了許多國家的學生。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A195","t":"行動者"},{"w":"protest","pos":"n.","def":"a public event where people show they disagree","cn":"抗議(活動)","s":"Thousands of students joined the climate ________ on Friday, and they carried signs asking leaders to act now.","zh":"數千名學生參加了星期五的氣候抗議活動,他們舉著標語要求領袖們立即行動。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A196","t":"抗議活動"},{"w":"greenwashing","pos":"n.","def":"making a product seem better for nature than it really is","cn":"漂綠","s":"The ad showed trees and rivers, but the company still burned coal, so critics called it ________.","zh":"這則廣告展示了樹木和河流,但這家公司仍在燒煤,所以批評者稱之為漂綠。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A197","t":"漂綠"},{"w":"carbon capture","pos":"n.phr.","def":"technology that catches carbon dioxide and stores it","cn":"碳捕捉","s":"The power plant is testing ______ ______ to trap its emissions, but the technology is still very expensive.","zh":"這座發電廠正在測試碳捕捉以收集其排放,但這項技術仍然非常昂貴。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A198","t":"碳捕捉"},{"w":"public transport","pos":"n.phr.","def":"buses and trains that everyone can use","cn":"大眾運輸","s":"If more people took ______ ______ instead of driving, the city would have less traffic and cleaner air.","zh":"如果更多人搭乘大眾運輸而不開車,城市就會有更少的車流和更乾淨的空氣。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A199","t":"大眾運輸"},{"w":"compost","pos":"v.","def":"to turn food and garden waste into natural fertiliser","cn":"堆肥","s":"Our family started to ________ vegetable scraps in the garden, and now we throw away much less rubbish.","zh":"我們家開始在花園裡把菜渣拿來堆肥,現在我們丟的垃圾少多了。","part":"A","sec":"Mitigation, Energy & Climate Policy 減緩、能源與氣候政策","lab":"A200","t":"堆肥"},{"w":"unprecedented","pos":"adj.","def":"never happened before","cn":"前所未有的","s":"The summer of 2023 brought ________ heat to many countries, and records that had stood for decades were broken.","zh":"2023年夏天為許多國家帶來前所未有的高溫,保持了數十年的紀錄紛紛被打破。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"前所未有的"},{"w":"profound","pos":"adj.","def":"very great or serious","cn":"深遠的;深刻的","s":"Rising seas will have a ________ effect on island nations, so their leaders are asking the world for urgent help.","zh":"海平面上升將對島國造成深遠的影響,所以它們的領袖正在向世界請求緊急協助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"深遠的"},{"w":"pivotal","pos":"adj.","def":"very important for what happens next","cn":"關鍵的","s":"The next ten years will be ________ for the climate, because decisions made now will affect the planet for centuries.","zh":"未來十年對氣候將是關鍵的,因為現在所做的決定將影響地球好幾個世紀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"關鍵的"},{"w":"curb","pos":"v.","def":"to control or limit something bad","cn":"抑制;控制","s":"The new rules aim to ________ air pollution from factories, but some owners say the changes are too expensive.","zh":"新規定的目的是抑制工廠的空氣污染,但有些業主說這些改變太昂貴了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"抑制"},{"w":"tackle","pos":"v.","def":"to deal with a difficult problem","cn":"處理;應對","s":"No single country can ________ climate change alone, so nations must share their technology, ideas and money.","zh":"沒有任何單一國家能獨自應對氣候變遷,所以各國必須分享它們的技術、想法和資金。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"應對"},{"w":"combat","pos":"v.","def":"to try to stop something harmful","cn":"對抗;打擊","s":"The city planted thousands of street trees to ________ rising temperatures, and some streets are now two degrees cooler.","zh":"市政府種了數千棵行道樹來對抗上升的氣溫,有些街道現在涼了兩度。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"對抗"},{"w":"foster","pos":"v.","def":"to help something develop","cn":"促進;培養","s":"The teacher wants to ________ a love of nature in her students, so she takes the class to the wetlands every month.","zh":"這位老師想培養學生對大自然的熱愛,所以她每個月都帶全班去濕地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"培養"},{"w":"bolster","pos":"v.","def":"to make something stronger","cn":"加強;支撐","s":"The government will ________ the river banks with stone, because last year's flood almost broke through.","zh":"政府將用石頭加強河岸,因為去年的洪水差點沖破堤防。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"加強"},{"w":"hinder","pos":"v.","def":"to make it difficult for something to happen","cn":"阻礙","s":"Heavy rain ________ the rescue work, but the teams kept searching for missing people all night.","zh":"大雨阻礙了救援工作,但救難隊仍整夜持續搜尋失蹤者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"阻礙"},{"w":"impede","pos":"v.","def":"to slow down or block progress","cn":"妨礙;阻止","s":"Fallen trees ________ traffic on the main road, so ambulances had to take a much longer route.","zh":"倒下的樹木妨礙了主要道路的交通,所以救護車不得不繞一條更遠的路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"妨礙"},{"w":"jeopardise","pos":"v.","def":"to put something in danger","cn":"危及;使陷入危險","s":"Warmer seas could ________ the fishing industry, and many coastal families would lose their main income.","zh":"較暖的海水可能危及漁業,許多沿海家庭將失去他們主要的收入。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"危及"},{"w":"compromise","pos":"n.","def":"an agreement where each side gives up something","cn":"妥協;折衷","s":"The two groups reached a ________ after long talks, so the wind farm will be built further from the fishing area.","zh":"兩個團體在長時間協商後達成妥協,所以風場將建在離漁場更遠的地方。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"妥協"},{"w":"escalate","pos":"v.","def":"to become more serious or bigger","cn":"升級;加劇","s":"The water dispute between the two farms began to ________, so the village leader invited them to a meeting.","zh":"兩座農場之間的用水糾紛開始加劇,所以村長邀請他們來開會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"加劇"},{"w":"surge","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden large increase","cn":"激增;暴增","s":"There was a ________ in electricity use during the heatwave, and the power company asked people to save energy.","zh":"熱浪期間用電量激增,電力公司要求民眾節約能源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"激增"},{"w":"plummet","pos":"v.","def":"to fall suddenly and by a large amount","cn":"暴跌;驟降","s":"Fish numbers ________ after the water became too warm, so the fishermen had to stay in port for weeks.","zh":"海水變得太暖之後魚群數量驟降,所以漁民不得不在港口停留好幾週。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"驟降"},{"w":"soar","pos":"v.","def":"to rise very quickly to a high level","cn":"飆升;猛增","s":"Vegetable prices ________ after the typhoon damaged the farms, so my mother bought frozen vegetables instead.","zh":"颱風損壞農田後菜價飆升,所以我媽媽改買冷凍蔬菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"飆升"},{"w":"proliferate","pos":"v.","def":"to increase quickly in number","cn":"激增;迅速增加","s":"Electric scooters have ________ in Taipei, and charging stations now appear on almost every street.","zh":"電動機車在台北迅速增加,現在幾乎每條街上都有充電站。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"迅速增加"},{"w":"amplify","pos":"v.","def":"to make something stronger or more serious","cn":"放大;增強","s":"Climate change can ________ natural dangers, so a normal storm may now cause much more damage.","zh":"氣候變遷可能放大自然災害的危險,所以一場普通的暴風雨現在可能造成更多損害。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"放大"},{"w":"magnify","pos":"v.","def":"to make something seem or become bigger","cn":"擴大;放大","s":"Poor building rules ________ the damage from earthquakes and floods, so experts want stricter checks.","zh":"不良的建築規範擴大了地震和洪水造成的損害,所以專家希望實施更嚴格的檢查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"擴大"},{"w":"trajectory","pos":"n.","def":"the path or direction of development","cn":"軌跡;發展趨勢","s":"On the current ________, the world will warm by almost three degrees, but faster action could change this path.","zh":"照目前的發展趨勢,世界將升溫將近三度,但更快的行動可以改變這條路徑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"發展趨勢"},{"w":"threshold","pos":"n.","def":"the level at which something starts to happen","cn":"門檻;臨界點","s":"Once the temperature passes a certain ________, coral begins to die, and recovery can take many years.","zh":"一旦溫度超過某個臨界點,珊瑚就開始死亡,而復原可能需要許多年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"臨界點"},{"w":"baseline","pos":"n.","def":"a starting point used for comparison","cn":"基準線","s":"The scientists used 1990 as the ________, so every later measurement could be compared with that year.","zh":"科學家們以1990年作為基準線,讓之後的每個測量值都可以與那一年比較。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"基準線"},{"w":"projection","pos":"n.","def":"an estimate of what will happen in the future","cn":"預測;推估","s":"The latest ________ shows that sea levels could rise by one metre, but this depends on how fast ice melts.","zh":"最新的推估顯示海平面可能上升一公尺,但這取決於冰融化的速度。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"推估"},{"w":"variable","pos":"n.","def":"a factor that can change","cn":"變數;變因","s":"Rainfall is an important ________ in the study, because it affects both crop growth and river levels.","zh":"降雨量是這項研究中的一個重要變數,因為它同時影響作物生長和河川水位。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"變數"},{"w":"correlate","pos":"v.","def":"to have a close connection","cn":"相關;相互關聯","s":"Hospital visits ________ closely with hot days, so doctors prepare extra beds when a heatwave is forecast.","zh":"醫院就診人數與炎熱天數密切相關,所以每當預報熱浪,醫生就會準備額外病床。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"相關"},{"w":"discrepancy","pos":"n.","def":"a difference between things that should match","cn":"差異;出入","s":"There was a ________ between the two temperature records, so the team checked the instruments again.","zh":"兩份溫度紀錄之間有出入,所以團隊再次檢查了儀器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"出入"},{"w":"consistently","pos":"adv.","def":"always in the same way","cn":"一貫地;始終","s":"The island has ________ recorded higher temperatures since 2000, and this pattern worries local farmers.","zh":"這座島自2000年以來始終記錄到較高的氣溫,這個模式讓當地農民很擔心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"始終"},{"w":"notably","pos":"adv.","def":"especially; in a way that is worth noticing","cn":"尤其;顯著地","s":"Many countries have cut emissions, ________ the UK, which has closed almost all of its coal power plants.","zh":"許多國家已經減少排放,尤其是英國,它已經關閉了幾乎所有的燃煤發電廠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"尤其"},{"w":"predominantly","pos":"adv.","def":"mainly; mostly","cn":"主要地;大多","s":"The region is ________ agricultural, so long dry seasons hurt almost every family's income there.","zh":"這個地區主要以農業為主,所以漫長的乾季幾乎影響當地每個家庭的收入。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"主要"},{"w":"substantially","pos":"adv.","def":"by a large amount","cn":"大幅地;相當多地","s":"The cost of solar panels has fallen ________ in ten years, so more families can now afford them.","zh":"太陽能板的成本在十年內大幅下降,所以現在更多家庭負擔得起。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"大幅"},{"w":"marginal","pos":"adj.","def":"very small and not important","cn":"微小的;邊際的","s":"Changing light bulbs makes only a ________ difference, but bigger changes like better buses can help a lot.","zh":"換燈泡只帶來微小的差異,但像改善公車這樣較大的改變可以幫助很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"微小的"},{"w":"negligible","pos":"adj.","def":"so small that it is not important","cn":"微不足道的","s":"The extra cost of the green design was ________, and the building saves a lot of money on energy every year.","zh":"綠色設計的額外成本微不足道,而這棟建築每年在能源上節省很多錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"微不足道"},{"w":"drastic","pos":"adj.","def":"extreme and having a strong effect","cn":"激烈的;大幅的","s":"Scientists say we need ________ cuts in emissions, because small changes will not stop dangerous warming.","zh":"科學家說我們需要大幅削減排放,因為小小的改變無法阻止危險的暖化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"大幅"},{"w":"severe","pos":"adj.","def":"very serious or bad","cn":"嚴重的;劇烈的","s":"The farm suffered ________ damage in the storm, but the family received help from neighbours and the government.","zh":"這座農場在暴風雨中受到嚴重的損害,但這家人得到鄰居和政府的幫助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"嚴重的"},{"w":"imminent","pos":"adj.","def":"going to happen very soon","cn":"即將發生的;迫在眉睫的","s":"The warning said a flood was ________, so families quickly moved their belongings to the second floor.","zh":"警報說洪水即將發生,所以家家戶戶趕緊把財物搬到二樓。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"即將發生"},{"w":"feasible","pos":"adj.","def":"possible and practical to do","cn":"可行的","s":"Building a wall around the whole island is not ________, so the government is looking for cheaper ideas.","zh":"在整座島周圍築牆並不可行,所以政府正在尋找較便宜的辦法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"可行"},{"w":"viable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to work successfully","cn":"可行的;能成功的","s":"Electric buses are now a ________ choice for small towns, because batteries have become cheaper and last longer.","zh":"電動公車現在對小鎮來說是可行的選擇,因為電池變得更便宜也更耐用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"可行的"},{"w":"pragmatic","pos":"adj.","def":"dealing with problems in a practical way","cn":"務實的","s":"The mayor took a ________ approach to flooding, and she fixed the drains before planning any big projects.","zh":"市長以務實的方式處理淹水問題,在規劃任何大型工程之前先修好了排水溝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"務實的"},{"w":"ambitious","pos":"adj.","def":"needing a lot of effort to achieve","cn":"雄心勃勃的;遠大的","s":"The country set an ________ goal of zero emissions by 2040, but it has not explained how it will pay for it.","zh":"這個國家訂下2040年零排放的遠大目標,但它還沒有說明要如何支付費用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"遠大"},{"w":"stringent","pos":"adj.","def":"very strict","cn":"嚴格的","s":"The European Union has ________ rules on car emissions, so companies must build cleaner engines to sell there.","zh":"歐盟對汽車排放有嚴格的規定,所以公司必須製造更乾淨的引擎才能在那裡銷售。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"嚴格的"},{"w":"lenient","pos":"adj.","def":"not strict enough","cn":"寬鬆的;寬容的","s":"Critics say the punishment for illegal dumping is too ________, so some companies simply pay the fine and continue.","zh":"批評者說非法傾倒的處罰太寬鬆,所以有些公司只是繳罰款然後繼續做。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"寬鬆"},{"w":"comprehensive","pos":"adj.","def":"including everything that is needed","cn":"全面的;綜合的","s":"The city published a ________ plan for heatwaves, and it covers schools, hospitals, buses and parks.","zh":"市政府發布了一份全面的熱浪應對計畫,內容涵蓋學校、醫院、公車和公園。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"全面的"},{"w":"holistic","pos":"adj.","def":"looking at the whole situation, not just parts","cn":"全面的;整體的","s":"Experts call for a ________ approach to water, so cities should think about rain, rivers and drinking water together.","zh":"專家呼籲對水資源採取整體的方法,所以城市應該把雨水、河川和飲用水放在一起考慮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"整體的"},{"w":"equitable","pos":"adj.","def":"fair to everyone","cn":"公平的;公正的","s":"The climate fund must be ________, because the poorest countries suffer the most but caused the least pollution.","zh":"氣候基金必須是公平的,因為最貧窮的國家受害最深,卻造成最少的污染。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"公平的"},{"w":"disproportionate","pos":"adj.","def":"too large or too small compared with something else","cn":"不成比例的","s":"Heatwaves have a ________ effect on old people, so nurses visit those who live alone during hot weather.","zh":"熱浪對老年人造成不成比例的影響,所以天氣炎熱時護理師會去探訪獨居者。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"不成比例的"},{"w":"fragile","pos":"adj.","def":"easily broken or damaged","cn":"脆弱的","s":"Mountain ecosystems are very ________, and even a small rise in temperature can change which plants survive there.","zh":"山區生態系非常脆弱,即使氣溫小幅上升也可能改變哪些植物能在那裡存活。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"脆弱"},{"w":"prioritise","pos":"v.","def":"to treat something as more important than other things","cn":"優先處理","s":"The town decided to ________ flood defences, so the new sports stadium will have to wait a few years.","zh":"鎮上決定優先處理防洪設施,所以新的運動場得等上幾年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"優先處理"},{"w":"mobilise","pos":"v.","def":"to organise people or resources for action","cn":"動員","s":"The school managed to ________ two hundred volunteers, and they cleaned the beach in just one morning.","zh":"學校成功動員了兩百名志工,他們只花一個早上就清乾淨了海灘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"動員"},{"w":"lobby","pos":"v.","def":"to try to influence politicians","cn":"遊說","s":"Oil companies ________ the government for years, so laws to cut emissions were delayed again and again.","zh":"石油公司多年來一直遊說政府,所以減排法律一再被延遲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"遊說"},{"w":"endorse","pos":"v.","def":"to publicly support something","cn":"支持;背書","s":"Several famous athletes ________ the tree-planting campaign, and thousands of young fans signed up to help.","zh":"幾位知名運動員公開支持植樹活動,數千名年輕粉絲報名參加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"支持"},{"w":"oppose","pos":"v.","def":"to disagree with and try to stop something","cn":"反對","s":"Local residents ________ the new airport, because it would destroy farmland and increase air pollution.","zh":"當地居民反對興建新機場,因為它會破壞農地並增加空氣污染。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"反對"},{"w":"reconcile","pos":"v.","def":"to find a way for two different ideas to exist together","cn":"調和;使一致","s":"It is hard to ________ economic growth with lower emissions, but some countries have managed to do both.","zh":"要調和經濟成長與降低排放很困難,但有些國家已經成功做到兩者兼顧。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"調和"},{"w":"concession","pos":"n.","def":"something you agree to give up in a discussion","cn":"讓步","s":"Rich countries made a ________ on climate funding, so the talks finally ended with an agreement.","zh":"富國在氣候資金上做出讓步,所以談判最終以達成協議收場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"讓步"},{"w":"levy","pos":"n.","def":"an official charge or tax","cn":"徵收的稅;稅款","s":"The airport introduced a small ________ on every flight, and the money is used to plant forests.","zh":"機場對每個航班徵收一筆小額稅款,這筆錢被用來種植森林。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"稅款"},{"w":"deploy","pos":"v.","def":"to put something into use or action","cn":"部署;運用","s":"The government will ________ more soldiers and boats to the coast, because a strong typhoon is on its way.","zh":"政府將在沿海部署更多士兵和船隻,因為一個強烈颱風正在逼近。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"部署"},{"w":"invest","pos":"v.","def":"to put money into something to get a benefit later","cn":"投資","s":"The city decided to ________ in bike lanes, and now many students ride to school instead of taking the bus.","zh":"市政府決定投資興建自行車道,現在許多學生改騎單車上學而不搭公車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"投資"},{"w":"expenditure","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of money spent","cn":"支出;花費","s":"Government ________ on disaster recovery has doubled, so less money is left for schools and hospitals.","zh":"政府在災後復原上的支出已經翻倍,所以留給學校和醫院的錢變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"支出"},{"w":"affordable","pos":"adj.","def":"cheap enough for most people to buy","cn":"負擔得起的","s":"Electric scooters are now more ________, so many young workers have changed from petrol models.","zh":"電動機車現在更負擔得起,所以許多年輕上班族已經從汽油車款換過去了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"負擔得起"},{"w":"cost-effective","pos":"adj.","def":"giving good results for the money spent","cn":"符合成本效益的","s":"Planting mangroves is a ________ way to protect the coast, and it also creates homes for fish and birds.","zh":"種植紅樹林是保護海岸符合成本效益的方法,同時也為魚類和鳥類創造棲息地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"符合成本效益的"},{"w":"interim","pos":"adj.","def":"temporary, until something permanent is ready","cn":"臨時的;過渡期的","s":"The families moved into ________ housing after the flood, but they hope to return home before New Year.","zh":"這些家庭在水災後搬進了臨時住所,但他們希望在新年前能回家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"臨時"},{"w":"transitional","pos":"adj.","def":"happening while changing from one state to another","cn":"過渡的;轉型的","s":"Natural gas is often called a ________ fuel, because it is cleaner than coal but still not truly clean.","zh":"天然氣常被稱為過渡燃料,因為它比煤乾淨,但仍不是真正的潔淨能源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"過渡"},{"w":"obligation","pos":"n.","def":"something you must do because of a law or promise","cn":"義務;責任","s":"Rich nations have an ________ to help poorer ones, because they produced most of the carbon in the past.","zh":"富國有義務幫助較貧窮的國家,因為它們過去製造了大部分的碳。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"義務"},{"w":"mandate","pos":"n.","def":"an official order to do something","cn":"命令;授權;規定","s":"The new ________ requires all new buildings to have solar panels, so builders are changing their designs.","zh":"新的規定要求所有新建築都必須裝設太陽能板,所以建商正在修改設計。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"規定"},{"w":"binding","pos":"adj.","def":"that must be obeyed by law","cn":"具有約束力的","s":"The agreement is not legally ________, so countries cannot be punished if they miss their targets.","zh":"這份協議在法律上不具約束力,所以各國即使未達目標也不會受到處罰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"具約束力"},{"w":"enact","pos":"v.","def":"to make a law","cn":"制定(法律);頒布","s":"The government plans to ________ a new climate law this year, and it will set limits for every industry.","zh":"政府計畫今年制定一部新的氣候法,而它將為每個產業設定上限。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"制定"},{"w":"dissent","pos":"n.","def":"strong disagreement with an official opinion","cn":"異議;不同意見","s":"There was some ________ among the scientists, but most of them agreed that the data showed clear warming.","zh":"科學家之間有一些異議,但他們大多數人都同意數據顯示出明顯的暖化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"異議"},{"w":"denial","pos":"n.","def":"refusing to accept that something is true","cn":"否認;否定","s":"Climate ________ is less common today, because people can see the effects of extreme weather with their own eyes.","zh":"氣候否定論如今較不常見,因為人們能親眼看見極端天氣的影響。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"否定"},{"w":"credible","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be believed or trusted","cn":"可信的","s":"Students should use ________ sources for their climate projects, so they should check who wrote each website.","zh":"學生的氣候專題應該使用可信的資料來源,所以他們應該查看每個網站是誰寫的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"可信的"},{"w":"rigorous","pos":"adj.","def":"very careful and thorough","cn":"嚴謹的;嚴格的","s":"The study used ________ methods, and other scientists were able to repeat it and get the same results.","zh":"這項研究使用了嚴謹的方法,其他科學家也能重複實驗並得到相同結果。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"嚴謹的"},{"w":"robust","pos":"adj.","def":"strong and unlikely to fail","cn":"強健的;穩固的","s":"The city needs a ________ water system, so it will not fail during the next long drought.","zh":"這座城市需要一個穩固的供水系統,這樣在下一次長期乾旱時才不會失靈。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"穩固的"},{"w":"peer-reviewed","pos":"adj.","def":"checked by other experts before being published","cn":"經同儕審查的","s":"The report was based on ________ research, so the government took its warnings very seriously.","zh":"這份報告是以經同儕審查的研究為基礎,所以政府非常認真看待其中的警告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"經同儕審查的"},{"w":"unanimous","pos":"adj.","def":"agreed by everyone","cn":"一致同意的","s":"The vote was ________, and every member of the student council supported the plan to ban plastic bottles.","zh":"這次投票是全體一致同意,學生會的每位成員都支持禁用塑膠瓶的計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"全體一致同意"},{"w":"contentious","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to cause disagreement","cn":"有爭議的","s":"Building a dam in the valley is a ________ issue, because it brings clean power but floods people's homes.","zh":"在山谷中興建水壩是一個有爭議的議題,因為它帶來潔淨電力卻也淹沒了人們的家園。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"有爭議的"},{"w":"pressing","pos":"adj.","def":"needing to be dealt with now","cn":"緊迫的;迫切的","s":"Clean water is the most ________ problem after the flood, so the army is bringing in large water tanks.","zh":"乾淨的水是水災過後最迫切的問題,所以軍隊正在運來大型水箱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"迫切的"},{"w":"urgency","pos":"n.","def":"the need to act quickly","cn":"緊迫性;急迫","s":"Young people speak about climate change with real ________, because they will live with the results for the longest time.","zh":"年輕人談論氣候變遷時帶著真切的急迫感,因為他們將承受後果最久。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"急迫感"},{"w":"collective","pos":"adj.","def":"done by a group of people together","cn":"集體的;共同的","s":"Climate change needs ________ action, so even small efforts by millions of people can make a difference.","zh":"氣候變遷需要集體行動,所以即使是數百萬人的小小努力也能帶來改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"集體"},{"w":"equity","pos":"n.","def":"fairness and equal treatment","cn":"公平;公正","s":"________ is an important part of climate policy, because poor families should not pay the highest price for change.","zh":"公平是氣候政策的重要部分,因為貧窮家庭不應該為改變付出最高的代價。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"公平"},{"w":"justice","pos":"n.","def":"fair treatment for everyone","cn":"正義;公正","s":"Activists call for climate ________, because the people least responsible for emissions often suffer the most.","zh":"行動者呼籲氣候正義,因為對排放責任最小的人往往受害最深。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"正義"},{"w":"burden","pos":"n.","def":"a heavy duty or problem that someone must deal with","cn":"負擔;重擔","s":"The cost of rebuilding after floods is a heavy ________ for small towns, so they need support from the central government.","zh":"水災後重建的費用對小鎮來說是沉重的負擔,所以它們需要中央政府的支援。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"負擔"},{"w":"liability","pos":"n.","def":"legal responsibility for something","cn":"(法律)責任","s":"The court decided the company had ________ for the oil spill, so it must pay to clean the beaches.","zh":"法院判決這家公司對漏油事件負有法律責任,所以它必須出錢清理海灘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"法律責任"},{"w":"cumulative","pos":"adj.","def":"increasing by adding one thing after another","cn":"累積的","s":"The ________ effect of small changes is large, so turning off lights every day really does save energy over time.","zh":"小小改變的累積效果很大,所以每天隨手關燈長期下來確實能節省能源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"累積"},{"w":"incremental","pos":"adj.","def":"happening in small steps","cn":"逐步的;漸進的","s":"The company is making ________ changes to its factories, but critics say it needs to move much faster.","zh":"這家公司正對工廠做逐步的改變,但批評者說它需要加快速度。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"逐步的"},{"w":"exponential","pos":"adj.","def":"increasing faster and faster","cn":"指數型的;急遽增加的","s":"The growth of solar power has been ________, and it now produces more electricity than anyone expected.","zh":"太陽能的成長呈指數型,現在它產生的電力比任何人預期的都多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"指數型"},{"w":"linear","pos":"adj.","def":"changing at a steady rate","cn":"線性的;直線的","s":"Sea level rise is not ________, so it may speed up suddenly if large ice sheets begin to break apart.","zh":"海平面上升並非線性的,所以如果大型冰原開始崩解,它可能會突然加速。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"線性的"},{"w":"variability","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of changing often","cn":"變化性;變異性","s":"Rainfall ________ makes farming difficult, because farmers never know whether the season will be wet or dry.","zh":"降雨的變化性讓務農變得困難,因為農夫永遠不知道這一季會是濕潤還是乾燥。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"變化性"},{"w":"magnitude","pos":"n.","def":"the great size or importance of something","cn":"規模;重要性","s":"Few people understood the ________ of the problem, so the government reacted too slowly at first.","zh":"很少人理解這個問題的規模,所以政府一開始反應太慢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"規模"},{"w":"scale","pos":"n.","def":"the size or level of something","cn":"規模","s":"The ________ of the flood shocked everyone, and the water covered an area larger than the whole city.","zh":"洪水的規模讓每個人都震驚,淹水範圍比整座城市還大。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"規模"},{"w":"extent","pos":"n.","def":"how large or serious something is","cn":"程度;範圍","s":"Satellites showed the ________ of the ice loss, and the photos made the news around the world.","zh":"衛星顯示了冰層流失的範圍,這些照片登上了全世界的新聞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"範圍"},{"w":"aggregate","pos":"adj.","def":"formed by adding together several amounts","cn":"總計的;合計的","s":"The ________ cost of the storms was billions of dollars, so insurance companies have raised their prices.","zh":"這些暴風雨總計的損失高達數十億美元,所以保險公司已經調漲了價格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"總計的"},{"w":"median","pos":"adj.","def":"in the middle of a set of numbers","cn":"中位數的","s":"The ________ temperature this June was the highest on record, and the hottest days were even worse.","zh":"今年六月的中位數氣溫是有紀錄以來最高的,而最熱的幾天更糟。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"中位數"},{"w":"quantify","pos":"v.","def":"to measure something as a number","cn":"量化","s":"It is difficult to ________ the value of a forest, because it gives us clean air, water and beauty.","zh":"要量化一座森林的價值很困難,因為它給予我們乾淨的空氣、水和美景。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"量化"},{"w":"calculate","pos":"v.","def":"to find an answer using numbers","cn":"計算","s":"We used an app to ________ our family's carbon footprint, and we were surprised by how much came from flying.","zh":"我們用一個應用程式計算全家的碳足跡,很驚訝有那麼多來自搭飛機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"計算"},{"w":"gauge","pos":"v.","def":"to judge or measure something","cn":"評估;估量","s":"It is hard to ________ public opinion on the new tax, so the city will hold online surveys next month.","zh":"很難評估民眾對新稅的看法,所以市政府下個月將舉辦線上調查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"評估"},{"w":"outline","pos":"v.","def":"to describe the main points of something","cn":"概述;簡述","s":"The minister ________ the new energy plan on TV, but she did not explain how much it would cost.","zh":"部長在電視上概述了新的能源計畫,但她沒有說明它會花多少錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"概述"},{"w":"elaborate","pos":"v.","def":"to give more details","cn":"詳細說明","s":"The reporter asked the scientist to ________ on her research, so she explained how the ice samples were collected.","zh":"記者請這位科學家詳細說明她的研究,所以她解釋了冰芯樣本是如何採集的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"詳細說明"},{"w":"articulate","pos":"v.","def":"to express ideas clearly","cn":"清楚表達","s":"The student was able to ________ her worries about the future, and the audience listened carefully.","zh":"這位學生能夠清楚表達她對未來的擔憂,觀眾都仔細聆聽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"清楚表達"},{"w":"convey","pos":"v.","def":"to communicate an idea or feeling","cn":"傳達","s":"The photo of the thin polar bear ________ the problem better than any graph, so it was shared millions of times.","zh":"那張瘦弱北極熊的照片比任何圖表都更能傳達問題,所以它被分享了數百萬次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"傳達"},{"w":"depict","pos":"v.","def":"to show something in a picture or story","cn":"描繪","s":"The film ________ a future city under water, and many viewers left the cinema feeling worried.","zh":"這部電影描繪了一座被水淹沒的未來城市,許多觀眾離開電影院時心情沉重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"描繪"},{"w":"portray","pos":"v.","def":"to describe or show someone or something in a certain way","cn":"描寫;刻劃","s":"The news often ________ farmers as victims, but many of them are also finding smart ways to adapt.","zh":"新聞常常把農民描寫成受害者,但他們之中許多人也在找尋聰明的調適方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"描寫"},{"w":"underscore","pos":"v.","def":"to emphasise that something is important","cn":"強調;凸顯","s":"The recent floods ________ the need for better drains, and the city council finally agreed to spend more money.","zh":"最近的水災凸顯了改善排水系統的必要,市議會終於同意投入更多經費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"凸顯"},{"w":"reiterate","pos":"v.","def":"to say something again for emphasis","cn":"重申","s":"The president ________ her promise to close the coal plants, but she did not give a date.","zh":"總統重申了她關閉燃煤電廠的承諾,但她沒有給出日期。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"重申"},{"w":"ascribe","pos":"v.","def":"to say that something is caused by a certain thing","cn":"把…歸因於","s":"Scientists ________ most of the recent warming to human activity, and they have strong data to support this.","zh":"科學家把近年大部分的暖化歸因於人類活動,而且他們有有力的數據支持。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"歸因於"},{"w":"arise / arose / arisen","pos":"v.","def":"to begin to happen or exist","cn":"出現;產生","s":"New problems ________ when the river dried up, so the farmers had to share water more carefully.","zh":"河川乾涸時新的問題出現了,所以農夫們必須更謹慎地分配用水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"出現"},{"w":"originate","pos":"v.","def":"to begin or come from somewhere","cn":"起源;源自","s":"Most typhoons that hit Taiwan ________ over the warm Pacific Ocean, and warmer water makes them stronger.","zh":"大多數侵襲台灣的颱風都源自溫暖的太平洋,而較暖的海水讓它們變得更強。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"源自"},{"w":"entail","pos":"v.","def":"to involve something as a necessary part","cn":"需要;牽涉","s":"Moving the whole village would ________ huge costs, so the leaders are looking at other options first.","zh":"遷移整個村莊將需要龐大的費用,所以領袖們先考慮其他選項。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"需要"},{"w":"necessitate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something necessary","cn":"使成為必要","s":"Rising sea levels will ________ new building rules, and older houses near the beach may have to be raised.","zh":"海平面上升將使新的建築規範成為必要,而海邊較舊的房子可能必須架高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"使 成為必要"},{"w":"warrant","pos":"v.","def":"to make an action seem right or necessary","cn":"使…有必要;值得","s":"The danger was serious enough to ________ an evacuation, so the police went from door to door.","zh":"危險嚴重到有必要進行撤離,所以警察挨家挨戶通知。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"有必要"},{"w":"encompass","pos":"v.","def":"to include many different things","cn":"包含;涵蓋","s":"The new course will ________ science, economics and history, so students can see climate change from many angles.","zh":"新課程將涵蓋科學、經濟和歷史,讓學生能從許多角度看待氣候變遷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"涵蓋"},{"w":"embody","pos":"v.","def":"to be a clear example of an idea","cn":"體現;代表","s":"The green school building ________ the idea of living with nature, and visitors come from all over Asia to see it.","zh":"這棟綠色校舍體現了與自然共存的理念,來自亞洲各地的訪客都來參觀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"體現"},{"w":"exemplify","pos":"v.","def":"to be a typical example of something","cn":"作為…的典範","s":"Copenhagen ________ how a city can cut emissions, because most people there cycle to work.","zh":"哥本哈根是城市如何減少排放的典範,因為那裡大多數人都騎單車上班。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"是 典範"},{"w":"manifest","pos":"v.","def":"to show something clearly","cn":"顯現;表現","s":"Climate change can ________ itself in many ways, such as stronger storms, longer droughts and earlier springs.","zh":"氣候變遷可能以許多方式顯現出來,例如更強的暴風雨、更長的乾旱和更早的春天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"顯現"},{"w":"prevail","pos":"v.","def":"to be common or most powerful at a certain time","cn":"盛行;占上風","s":"Strong winds ________ along the west coast in winter, so it is a good place to build wind farms.","zh":"冬季西海岸盛行強風,所以那裡是興建風場的好地點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"盛行"},{"w":"pervasive","pos":"adj.","def":"spreading widely through every part","cn":"無所不在的;普遍的","s":"Plastic pollution is ________ in the ocean, and scientists have found tiny pieces even in deep sea fish.","zh":"塑膠污染在海洋中無所不在,科學家甚至在深海魚體內也發現了微小碎片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"無所不在"},{"w":"ubiquitous","pos":"adj.","def":"seeming to be everywhere","cn":"隨處可見的","s":"Air-conditioners are ________ in Taipei apartments, but they push hot air into the streets and make the city warmer.","zh":"冷氣在台北的公寓裡隨處可見,但它們把熱空氣排到街上,讓城市變得更熱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"隨處可見"},{"w":"conventional","pos":"adj.","def":"normal and traditional","cn":"傳統的;常規的","s":"________ farming uses a lot of chemicals, but some farmers are trying natural methods to protect the soil.","zh":"傳統的農業使用大量化學物質,但一些農夫正嘗試自然的方法來保護土壤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"傳統的"},{"w":"orthodox","pos":"adj.","def":"generally accepted as correct","cn":"正統的;傳統的","s":"The young engineer questioned the ________ way of building dams, and her new design used much less concrete.","zh":"這位年輕工程師質疑建造水壩的傳統方式,她的新設計使用了少得多的混凝土。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"傳統"},{"w":"novel","pos":"adj.","def":"new and different","cn":"新穎的","s":"The students came up with a ________ idea for cooling classrooms, and they won first prize at the science fair.","zh":"學生們想出一個為教室降溫的新穎點子,並在科展中獲得第一名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"新穎"},{"w":"outdated","pos":"adj.","def":"old and no longer useful","cn":"過時的","s":"The city's flood maps are ________, so many new homes have been built in areas that are actually dangerous.","zh":"這座城市的淹水地圖已經過時,所以許多新房子蓋在其實很危險的地區。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"過時"},{"w":"tentative","pos":"adj.","def":"not certain or final","cn":"暫定的;試探性的","s":"The two countries reached a ________ agreement, but they still need to discuss the details next month.","zh":"兩國達成了暫定的協議,但它們下個月仍需要討論細節。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"暫定的"},{"w":"provisional","pos":"adj.","def":"arranged for now but may change later","cn":"臨時的;暫定的","s":"The ________ results show that this was the hottest year ever, and the final report will come out in spring.","zh":"暫定的結果顯示今年是史上最熱的一年,最終報告將於春天發布。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"暫定的"},{"w":"definitive","pos":"adj.","def":"final and not able to be changed","cn":"明確的;決定性的","s":"There is no ________ answer to the question yet, so scientists will continue to collect data for several more years.","zh":"這個問題目前還沒有明確的答案,所以科學家會再繼續收集數年的資料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"明確的"},{"w":"conclusive","pos":"adj.","def":"proving something without doubt","cn":"確鑿的;決定性的","s":"The evidence for human-caused warming is ________, and almost every climate scientist agrees with it.","zh":"人為造成暖化的證據是確鑿的,幾乎每位氣候科學家都同意。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"確鑿的"},{"w":"plausible","pos":"adj.","def":"seeming reasonable or likely to be true","cn":"合理的;似乎可信的","s":"Her explanation for the fish deaths was ________, but the team still tested the water to make sure.","zh":"她對魚群死亡的解釋合理,但團隊仍然檢驗了水質以確認。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"合理"},{"w":"flawed","pos":"adj.","def":"having mistakes or weaknesses","cn":"有缺陷的","s":"The report was ________ because it used only one year of data, so other experts did not trust its conclusions.","zh":"這份報告有缺陷,因為它只用了一年的數據,所以其他專家不信任它的結論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"有缺陷"},{"w":"impartial","pos":"adj.","def":"not supporting one side more than another","cn":"公正的;不偏袒的","s":"The committee must stay ________, so none of its members can work for oil or gas companies.","zh":"委員會必須保持公正,所以其成員都不能為石油或天然氣公司工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"公正"},{"w":"clarity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being clear and easy to understand","cn":"清楚;明確","s":"Businesses want ________ about future energy rules, because they need to plan their investments for many years.","zh":"企業希望未來的能源規定能更明確,因為他們需要為多年的投資做規劃。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"明確"},{"w":"nuance","pos":"n.","def":"a small but important difference in meaning","cn":"細微差別","s":"The debate on nuclear power needs more ________, because it is not simply good or bad.","zh":"關於核能的辯論需要更多細微的區辨,因為它並不是單純的好或壞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"細微的區辨"},{"w":"simplistic","pos":"adj.","def":"treating a problem as simpler than it really is","cn":"過度簡化的","s":"Saying that planting trees will solve everything is ________, because we also need to cut emissions.","zh":"說種樹就能解決一切是過度簡化的想法,因為我們也需要減少排放。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"過度簡化的"},{"w":"oversimplify","pos":"v.","def":"to describe something in a way that is too simple","cn":"過度簡化","s":"Headlines often ________ scientific reports, so readers may not understand how uncertain some results are.","zh":"新聞標題常常過度簡化科學報告,所以讀者可能不了解某些結果有多不確定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"過度簡化"},{"w":"generalise","pos":"v.","def":"to say something is true for all cases","cn":"概括;一概而論","s":"We should not ________ from one cold winter, because climate is about long-term patterns, not a single season.","zh":"我們不應該從一個寒冷的冬天就一概而論,因為氣候講的是長期模式,而不是單一季節。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"一概而論"},{"w":"rationale","pos":"n.","def":"the reasons for a decision","cn":"基本原理;理由","s":"The mayor explained the ________ for the new parking fees, and she said the money would pay for more buses.","zh":"市長解釋了新停車費的理由,她說這筆錢將用來增加公車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"理由"},{"w":"metric","pos":"n.","def":"a way of measuring something","cn":"指標;衡量標準","s":"Carbon per person is a useful ________, but it does not show which countries polluted the most in the past.","zh":"人均碳排放是一個有用的指標,但它無法顯示哪些國家過去污染最多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"指標"},{"w":"benchmark","pos":"n.","def":"a standard used for comparison","cn":"基準;標竿","s":"The new office became a ________ for green buildings, and other companies copied many of its ideas.","zh":"這棟新辦公室成為綠建築的標竿,其他公司仿效了它的許多設計。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"標竿"},{"w":"parameter","pos":"n.","def":"a limit or rule that controls how something is done","cn":"參數;界限","s":"The model uses several ________ such as wind speed and temperature, so its forecasts are quite accurate.","zh":"這個模型使用了幾個參數,例如風速和溫度,所以它的預報相當準確。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"參數"},{"w":"paradigm","pos":"n.","def":"a typical model or way of thinking","cn":"範式;模式","s":"Renewable energy has changed the old ________ of power, so homes can now produce electricity as well as use it.","zh":"可再生能源改變了舊有的電力模式,所以家庭現在既能用電也能發電。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"模式"},{"w":"discrete","pos":"adj.","def":"clearly separate","cn":"分離的;個別的","s":"The study divided the coast into ________ sections, and each part was tested for erosion separately.","zh":"這項研究把海岸劃分為個別的區段,每個部分都分別進行侵蝕檢測。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"個別的"},{"w":"overwhelmingly","pos":"adv.","def":"very strongly; by a very large amount","cn":"壓倒性地","s":"The public ________ supported the new park, so the city cancelled its plan to build a shopping mall there.","zh":"民眾壓倒性地支持新公園,所以市政府取消了在那裡蓋購物中心的計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"壓倒性地"},{"w":"whereby","pos":"adv.","def":"by which; through which","cn":"藉此;憑此","s":"The town created a system ________ people can borrow electric bikes for free, and it has reduced traffic a lot.","zh":"鎮上建立了一個制度,藉此民眾可以免費借用電動自行車,而它大幅減少了車流。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"藉此"},{"w":"likewise","pos":"adv.","def":"in the same way","cn":"同樣地","s":"Our school turned off the lights at lunchtime, and the school next door did ________, so both saved energy.","zh":"我們學校在午餐時間關燈,隔壁學校也同樣這麼做,所以兩校都節省了能源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"同樣"},{"w":"so-called","pos":"adj.","def":"used to show that a name may not be accurate","cn":"所謂的","s":"The ________ green bags were made of thick plastic, so they were actually worse for the environment.","zh":"那些所謂的環保袋是用厚塑膠做的,所以它們其實對環境更糟。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"所謂的"},{"w":"unforeseen","pos":"adj.","def":"not expected or predicted","cn":"未預見的;意料之外的","s":"The project faced ________ problems, but the engineers solved them and finished the seawall on time.","zh":"這項工程遇到意料之外的問題,但工程師們解決了它們並準時完成海堤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"意料之外的"},{"w":"undertake / undertook / undertaken","pos":"v.","def":"to start doing a job or task","cn":"承擔;進行","s":"The university ________ a five-year study of the river, and the results helped the city plan new flood walls.","zh":"這所大學進行了一項為期五年的河川研究,其結果幫助市政府規劃新的防洪牆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"進行"},{"w":"forthcoming","pos":"adj.","def":"going to happen soon","cn":"即將到來的","s":"The ________ climate summit will be held in Asia, so many local groups are preparing to attend.","zh":"即將到來的氣候高峰會將在亞洲舉行,所以許多在地團體正準備參加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"即將到來的"},{"w":"finite","pos":"adj.","def":"having a limit","cn":"有限的","s":"Oil and coal are ________ resources, so the world will have to replace them sooner or later.","zh":"石油和煤是有限的資源,所以世界遲早必須取代它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"有限的"},{"w":"constant","pos":"adj.","def":"happening all the time","cn":"持續不斷的","s":"The village faces ________ danger from rising water, but many families do not want to leave their land.","zh":"這個村莊面臨上升海水持續不斷的威脅,但許多家庭不想離開他們的土地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"持續不斷的"},{"w":"circumstance","pos":"n.","def":"a fact or condition that affects a situation","cn":"情況;情勢","s":"Under normal ________ the river is calm, but after heavy rain it can rise by three metres in a few hours.","zh":"在正常情況下河水很平靜,但大雨過後它可能在幾小時內上漲三公尺。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"情況"},{"w":"contrast","pos":"n.","def":"a clear difference between two things","cn":"對比;差異","s":"There is a sharp ________ between the cool forest and the hot city, so many families go to the mountains on weekends.","zh":"涼爽的森林和炎熱的城市之間有明顯的對比,所以許多家庭週末都會上山。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"對比"},{"w":"convention","pos":"n.","def":"a formal agreement between countries","cn":"公約","s":"The United Nations climate ________ was signed in 1992, and countries have met every year since then.","zh":"聯合國氣候公約於1992年簽署,此後各國每年都會開會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"公約"},{"w":"ideology","pos":"n.","def":"a set of political ideas or beliefs","cn":"意識形態","s":"Climate policy should be based on science rather than ________, but in some countries it has become very political.","zh":"氣候政策應該以科學為基礎而非意識形態,但在某些國家它已變得非常政治化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"意識形態"},{"w":"intermediate","pos":"adj.","def":"between two levels or stages","cn":"中間的;中級的","s":"The plan has an ________ target for 2030, so the country can check its progress before the final goal.","zh":"這項計畫訂有2030年的中期目標,讓國家能在最終目標之前檢視進度。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"中期"},{"w":"invoke","pos":"v.","def":"to use a law or rule to support an action","cn":"援引;行使","s":"The president ________ emergency powers after the flood, so the army could help with rescue work at once.","zh":"水災後總統行使緊急權力,讓軍隊能立刻協助救援工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"行使"},{"w":"mediate","pos":"v.","def":"to help two sides reach an agreement","cn":"調解;斡旋","s":"A local professor agreed to ________ between the fishermen and the energy company, and both sides finally signed a deal.","zh":"一位當地教授同意在漁民和能源公司之間調解,雙方最終簽署了協議。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"調解"},{"w":"regime","pos":"n.","def":"a system of rules or government","cn":"體制;制度","s":"The new tax ________ rewards companies that pollute less, so many factories are buying cleaner machines.","zh":"新的稅收制度獎勵污染較少的公司,所以許多工廠正在購買更乾淨的機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"制度"},{"w":"successor","pos":"n.","def":"a person or thing that comes after another","cn":"繼任者;後繼者","s":"The old agreement ended in 2020, and its ________ sets stronger goals for every country.","zh":"舊協議在2020年結束,而它的後繼協議為每個國家訂定了更強的目標。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"後繼"},{"w":"unify","pos":"v.","def":"to bring people or things together","cn":"統一;使團結","s":"The flood helped to ________ the community, because neighbours who had never spoken started to help each other.","zh":"這場水災幫助團結了社區,因為從未交談過的鄰居開始互相幫忙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"團結"},{"w":"sphere","pos":"n.","def":"an area of activity or interest","cn":"領域;範圍","s":"Climate change affects every ________ of life, so it is discussed in science, business and even art classes.","zh":"氣候變遷影響生活的每個領域,所以它在科學、商業,甚至藝術課中都會被討論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"領域"},{"w":"qualitative","pos":"adj.","def":"about quality rather than numbers","cn":"質性的;定性的","s":"The team collected ________ data by talking to farmers, because numbers alone could not show how they felt.","zh":"團隊透過與農夫交談收集了質性資料,因為光靠數字無法呈現他們的感受。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"質性"},{"w":"thesis","pos":"n.","def":"a long piece of writing for a university degree","cn":"論文","s":"My cousin wrote her ________ on heat in Taipei, and the city government used some of her ideas.","zh":"我表姐寫了一篇關於台北高溫的論文,市政府採用了她的一些想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"論文"},{"w":"equate","pos":"v.","def":"to think that two things are the same","cn":"把…等同於","s":"Many people ________ a warm winter with good weather, but it can actually harm crops and insects.","zh":"許多人把暖冬等同於好天氣,但它其實可能傷害作物和昆蟲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"等同於"},{"w":"attitude","pos":"n.","def":"the way you think or feel about something","cn":"態度","s":"Public ________ towards electric cars has changed, and now many young people say they will never buy a petrol car.","zh":"大眾對電動車的態度已經改變,現在許多年輕人說他們永遠不會買汽油車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"態度"},{"w":"availability","pos":"n.","def":"how easy something is to get or use","cn":"可取得性;供應","s":"The ________ of clean water is falling in some regions, so people walk further every day to find it.","zh":"某些地區乾淨水源的供應正在減少,所以人們每天要走更遠才能取得。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"供應"},{"w":"comprehend","pos":"v.","def":"to understand something fully","cn":"理解","s":"It is hard to ________ how fast the ice is melting, so the scientist showed us photos taken ten years apart.","zh":"很難理解冰融化的速度有多快,所以這位科學家給我們看了相隔十年拍攝的照片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"理解"},{"w":"deem","pos":"v.","def":"to consider or judge something in a certain way","cn":"認為;視為","s":"The bridge was ________ unsafe after the earthquake, so cars had to use a road ten kilometres away.","zh":"地震後這座橋被認為不安全,所以汽車必須改走十公里外的道路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"認為"},{"w":"discern","pos":"v.","def":"to notice or understand something that is not obvious","cn":"察覺;辨別","s":"It is difficult to ________ a clear trend from one year of data, so researchers look at records over many decades.","zh":"很難從一年的數據中察覺出明確的趨勢,所以研究人員會檢視數十年的紀錄。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"察覺"},{"w":"accomplish","pos":"v.","def":"to succeed in doing something","cn":"完成;達成","s":"The village ________ its goal of using only solar power, and other towns are now asking how they did it.","zh":"這個村莊達成了只使用太陽能的目標,其他城鎮現在都在詢問他們是怎麼做到的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"達成"},{"w":"abate","pos":"v.","def":"to become less strong","cn":"減弱;緩和","s":"The rescue boats waited until the storm began to ________, and then they went out to find the missing fishermen.","zh":"救援船等到暴風雨開始減弱,接著才出海搜尋失蹤的漁民。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"減弱"},{"w":"hasten","pos":"v.","def":"to make something happen sooner","cn":"加速;促進","s":"The heat ________ the melting of the glacier, so the river flooded villages downstream in July.","zh":"高溫加速了冰河的融化,所以河水在七月淹沒了下游的村莊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"加速"},{"w":"augment","pos":"v.","def":"to increase the size or value of something","cn":"增加;擴大","s":"The city will ________ its water supply with rainwater tanks, because the reservoir alone is no longer enough.","zh":"市政府將以雨水儲水槽來擴大供水量,因為光靠水庫已經不夠了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"擴大"},{"w":"erratic","pos":"adj.","def":"changing often in a way that cannot be predicted","cn":"不穩定的;無規律的","s":"The weather has become very ________ in recent years, so farmers are not sure when to plant their seeds.","zh":"近年來天氣變得非常不穩定,所以農夫不確定何時該播種。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"不穩定"},{"w":"volatile","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to change suddenly","cn":"多變的;不穩定的","s":"Oil prices are very ________, so countries that use more renewable energy are better protected from sudden changes.","zh":"油價非常多變,所以使用較多可再生能源的國家較不受突然變化的影響。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"多變"},{"w":"intermittent","pos":"adj.","def":"stopping and starting again","cn":"間歇性的","s":"Wind and solar power are ________, so we need batteries to store energy for times without sun or wind.","zh":"風力和太陽能是間歇性的,所以我們需要電池在沒有陽光或風的時候儲存能源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"間歇性的"},{"w":"sporadic","pos":"adj.","def":"happening only sometimes","cn":"零星的;偶發的","s":"There was only ________ rain during the spring, so the reservoirs were nearly empty by June.","zh":"春天只下了零星的雨,所以到六月時水庫幾乎見底。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"零星的"},{"w":"prolonged","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting for a long time","cn":"長期的;持久的","s":"A ________ drought dried up the rivers, and many farmers had to sell their animals.","zh":"一場長期乾旱讓河川乾涸,許多農夫不得不賣掉他們的牲畜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"長期"},{"w":"recurrent","pos":"adj.","def":"happening again and again","cn":"反覆發生的","s":"________ flooding has damaged the old market many times, so the shop owners finally agreed to move.","zh":"反覆發生的淹水多次損壞了老市場,所以店家們最終同意搬遷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"反覆發生的"},{"w":"invariably","pos":"adv.","def":"always; every time","cn":"總是;一律","s":"Heavy rain ________ causes traffic jams in the city, so many people now work from home on stormy days.","zh":"大雨總是造成市區交通堵塞,所以許多人現在在暴風雨的日子都在家工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"總是"},{"w":"arguably","pos":"adv.","def":"used to say something may be true, though some may disagree","cn":"可以說;按理說","s":"Climate change is ________ the biggest challenge of our time, but many people still do not think about it every day.","zh":"氣候變遷可以說是我們這個時代最大的挑戰,但許多人仍然不會每天想到它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"可以說"},{"w":"conversely","pos":"adv.","def":"in the opposite way","cn":"相反地","s":"Some regions will get more rain; ________, others will become much drier, so farming must change in both places.","zh":"有些地區會有更多降雨;相反地,其他地區會變得更加乾燥,所以兩地的農業都必須改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"相反地"},{"w":"thereafter","pos":"adv.","def":"after that time","cn":"此後;之後","s":"The factory closed in 2015, and ________ the river slowly became clean enough for fish to return.","zh":"工廠在2015年關閉,此後河川慢慢變得乾淨到足以讓魚群回來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"此後"},{"w":"markedly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is clear and easy to notice","cn":"明顯地","s":"Air quality improved ________ during the holiday, because fewer cars were on the road and factories were closed.","zh":"假期期間空氣品質明顯改善,因為路上的車少了,工廠也關閉了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"明顯"},{"w":"steadily","pos":"adv.","def":"gradually and in a regular way","cn":"穩定地;逐步地","s":"The number of electric buses has grown ________, and the city hopes all buses will be electric by 2030.","zh":"電動公車的數量穩定地成長,市政府希望在2030年前所有公車都改為電動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"穩定地"},{"w":"concurrently","pos":"adv.","def":"at the same time","cn":"同時地","s":"The city is building a new seawall and ________ planting mangroves, so the coast will have two kinds of protection.","zh":"市政府正在興建新海堤,並同時種植紅樹林,讓海岸擁有兩種保護。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"同時"},{"w":"respectively","pos":"adv.","def":"in the same order as the things just mentioned","cn":"分別地","s":"Wind and solar produced twenty and fifteen percent of the power ________, so clean energy is growing fast.","zh":"風力和太陽能分別提供了百分之二十和百分之十五的電力,所以潔淨能源成長迅速。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"分別"},{"w":"accordingly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that fits the situation","cn":"相應地;因此","s":"The forecast said the storm would be strong, so the school planned ________ and moved all classes online.","zh":"預報說暴風雨會很強烈,所以學校相應地做了安排,把所有課程改為線上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"相應地"},{"w":"admittedly","pos":"adv.","def":"used when you agree that something is true","cn":"誠然;無可否認地","s":"________, solar panels are expensive at first, but they save money on electricity for many years.","zh":"誠然,太陽能板一開始很貴,但它們能在許多年間節省電費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"誠然"},{"w":"seemingly","pos":"adv.","def":"appearing to be true, but perhaps not","cn":"表面上;看似","s":"The river looked ________ clean, but tests showed that it contained dangerous chemicals from the farms.","zh":"這條河看似很乾淨,但檢驗顯示它含有來自農場的危險化學物質。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"看似"},{"w":"allegedly","pos":"adv.","def":"said to be true, but not proved","cn":"據說;據稱","s":"The company ________ dumped waste into the sea, and the police are now checking its records.","zh":"這家公司據稱把廢棄物倒入海中,警方目前正在調查它的紀錄。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"據稱"},{"w":"relatively","pos":"adv.","def":"compared with other things","cn":"相對地;比較","s":"The changes needed are ________ simple, but they require people to give up some old habits.","zh":"所需的改變相對簡單,但它們需要人們放棄一些舊習慣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"相對"},{"w":"virtually","pos":"adv.","def":"almost completely","cn":"幾乎;實際上","s":"The lake had ________ disappeared by the end of summer, so the boat owners had nothing to do.","zh":"到夏末時湖泊幾乎消失了,所以船主們無事可做。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"幾乎"},{"w":"thorough","pos":"adj.","def":"careful and complete","cn":"徹底的;周密的","s":"The engineers made a ________ check of the dam after the earthquake, and they found two small cracks.","zh":"地震後工程師們對水壩做了徹底的檢查,並發現了兩道小裂縫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"徹底的"},{"w":"meticulous","pos":"adj.","def":"very careful about details","cn":"一絲不苟的;細心的","s":"She kept ________ records of the birds in her garden for thirty years, so scientists used them to study climate change.","zh":"她三十年來一絲不苟地記錄自家花園裡的鳥類,所以科學家用這些紀錄來研究氣候變遷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"一絲不苟地"},{"w":"systematic","pos":"adj.","def":"done according to a careful plan","cn":"有系統的","s":"The team used a ________ method to count the trees, and they checked every square of the forest map.","zh":"團隊使用有系統的方法計算樹木數量,並檢查了森林地圖上的每一格。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"有系統的"},{"w":"cohesive","pos":"adj.","def":"united and working well together","cn":"有凝聚力的","s":"A ________ community recovers faster after a disaster, because neighbours share tools, food and information.","zh":"有凝聚力的社區在災後復原得更快,因為鄰居們會分享工具、食物和資訊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"有凝聚力的"},{"w":"indispensable","pos":"adj.","def":"too important to be without","cn":"不可或缺的","s":"Weather satellites are ________ for typhoon forecasts, so countries share their data with each other.","zh":"氣象衛星對颱風預報是不可或缺的,所以各國彼此分享資料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"不可或缺的"},{"w":"paramount","pos":"adj.","def":"more important than anything else","cn":"最重要的;至高無上的","s":"Safety is ________ during a typhoon, so people should stay indoors even if the wind seems weak.","zh":"颱風期間安全是最重要的,所以即使風看起來很弱,人們也應該待在室內。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"最重要的"},{"w":"salient","pos":"adj.","def":"most important or noticeable","cn":"最顯著的;重要的","s":"The report listed the ________ points on the first page, so busy leaders could understand it quickly.","zh":"報告在第一頁列出了最重要的重點,讓忙碌的領袖們能快速理解。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"最重要的"},{"w":"prominent","pos":"adj.","def":"important and well known","cn":"著名的;重要的","s":"A ________ scientist spoke at the conference, and her warning about sea level rise made the evening news.","zh":"一位著名的科學家在會議上發表演說,她對海平面上升的警告登上了晚間新聞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"著名的"},{"w":"conspicuous","pos":"adj.","def":"very easy to see or notice","cn":"顯眼的;明顯的","s":"The damage to the forest was ________ from the plane, and large brown areas stretched across the hills.","zh":"從飛機上看森林的損害非常明顯,大片褐色區域橫跨整個山丘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"明顯"},{"w":"tangible","pos":"adj.","def":"real and able to be seen or measured","cn":"具體的;實質的","s":"Students want ________ results from the climate club, so they track how much rubbish they collect each month.","zh":"學生們希望氣候社團有具體的成果,所以他們記錄每個月收集了多少垃圾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"具體的"},{"w":"refute","pos":"v.","def":"to prove that something is wrong","cn":"駁斥;反駁","s":"The scientist used clear data to ________ the false claim, and the video was watched by millions of people.","zh":"這位科學家用明確的數據駁斥了錯誤的說法,這段影片被數百萬人觀看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"駁斥"},{"w":"corroborate","pos":"v.","def":"to support an idea with new evidence","cn":"證實;佐證","s":"Satellite images ________ what the villagers said, because the glacier had clearly become much smaller.","zh":"衛星影像證實了村民所說的話,因為冰河明顯變小了很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"證實"},{"w":"global warming","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the rise in the Earth's average temperature","cn":"全球暖化","s":"______ ______ is making summers longer in Taiwan, so schools are thinking about starting classes earlier in the morning.","zh":"全球暖化正讓台灣的夏天變得更長,所以學校正在考慮早上提早開始上課。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"全球暖化"},{"w":"carbon footprint","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the amount of carbon a person or activity produces","cn":"碳足跡","s":"Flying to Europe adds a lot to your ______ ______, so my family took a train trip around Taiwan this year.","zh":"飛往歐洲會大幅增加你的碳足跡,所以我們家今年改搭火車環島旅行。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"碳足跡"},{"w":"extreme weather","pos":"n.phr.","def":"very unusual and dangerous weather","cn":"極端天氣","s":"______ ______ such as floods and heatwaves is becoming more common, and cities must prepare for it.","zh":"像水災和熱浪這樣的極端天氣變得越來越常見,城市必須為此做好準備。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"極端天氣"},{"w":"tipping point","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the moment when a small change causes a big, sudden effect","cn":"臨界點;轉捩點","s":"Scientists fear the rainforest may reach a ______ ______, and then it could slowly turn into dry grassland.","zh":"科學家擔心雨林可能達到臨界點,接著它可能慢慢變成乾燥的草原。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"臨界點"},{"w":"a ticking time bomb","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a problem that will become very serious soon","cn":"定時炸彈;隨時會爆發的問題","s":"Experts call the melting permafrost ______ ______ ______ ______, because it holds huge amounts of gas that could escape.","zh":"專家把融化中的永凍土稱為一顆定時炸彈,因為它蘊含大量可能逸散的氣體。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"一顆定時炸彈"},{"w":"for future generations","pos":"phr.","def":"for people who will live after us","cn":"為了後代子孫","s":"We must protect the forests ______ ______ ______, because our children and grandchildren will need clean air and water too.","zh":"我們必須為了後代子孫保護森林,因為我們的孩子和孫子也會需要乾淨的空氣和水。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"為了後代子孫"},{"w":"cut down on","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to use or do less of something","cn":"減少","s":"Our family decided to ______ ______ ______ meat, because farming animals produces a lot of greenhouse gases.","zh":"我們家決定減少吃肉,因為飼養動物會產生大量溫室氣體。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"減少"},{"w":"phase out","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to stop using something gradually","cn":"逐步淘汰","s":"The government plans to ______ ______ petrol scooters by 2035, so new buyers are already choosing electric ones.","zh":"政府計畫在2035年前逐步淘汰汽油機車,所以新買家已經在選擇電動機車了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"逐步淘汰"},{"w":"go green","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start living or working in a way that is better for the environment","cn":"走向環保;綠化","s":"The café decided to ______ ______ last year, so it stopped using plastic straws and started selling local food.","zh":"這家咖啡廳去年決定走向環保,所以它停止使用塑膠吸管並開始販售在地食材。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"走向環保"},{"w":"run out of","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to have no more of something left","cn":"用完;耗盡","s":"If the rain does not come soon, the town will ______ ______ ______ drinking water, so people are saving every drop.","zh":"如果雨再不來,鎮上就會用完飲用水,所以人們正在節約每一滴水。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"用完"},{"w":"the tip of the iceberg","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small, visible part of a much bigger problem","cn":"冰山一角","s":"The flooded streets were only ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, because the storm had also damaged farms and power lines.","zh":"淹水的街道只是冰山一角,因為暴風雨也損壞了農場和電線。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"冰山一角"},{"w":"weather the storm","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to get through a difficult time successfully","cn":"度過難關","s":"The small farm lost half its crops, but the family managed to ______ ______ ______ with help from the community.","zh":"這座小農場損失了一半的作物,但這家人在社區的幫助下設法度過難關。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"度過難關"},{"w":"bear the brunt of","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to suffer the worst part of something","cn":"首當其衝;承受最大衝擊","s":"Poor coastal villages ______ ______ ______ ______ rising seas, but they produced almost none of the pollution.","zh":"貧窮的沿海村莊首當其衝承受海平面上升的衝擊,但它們幾乎沒有製造任何污染。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"首當其衝"},{"w":"a race against time","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a situation where you must work very fast to finish before it is too late","cn":"與時間賽跑","s":"Saving the coral reef is ______ ______ ______ ______, because the water is getting warmer every summer.","zh":"拯救珊瑚礁是一場與時間賽跑,因為海水每年夏天都在變暖。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"與時間賽跑"},{"w":"sound the alarm","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to warn people about a danger","cn":"敲響警鐘;發出警告","s":"Scientists ______ ______ ______ about melting ice many years ago, but governments were slow to listen.","zh":"科學家多年前就對融冰敲響了警鐘,但政府遲遲不願傾聽。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"敲響了警鐘"},{"w":"take steps to","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to do things in order to achieve something","cn":"採取措施","s":"Our school has ______ ______ ______ save energy, and we now turn off all fans when we leave the classroom.","zh":"我們學校已經採取措施節約能源,現在我們離開教室時都會關掉所有電扇。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"採取措施"},{"w":"on the rise","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"increasing","cn":"正在上升;日益增加","s":"Heat-related illnesses are ______ ______ ______, so doctors advise people to drink water and stay out of the midday sun.","zh":"與高溫相關的疾病正在增加,所以醫生建議民眾多喝水並避開正午的陽光。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"正在增加"},{"w":"in the face of","pos":"phr.","def":"when dealing with a difficult situation","cn":"面對","s":"______ ______ ______ ______ rising seas, the islanders have kept their culture alive, but many young people have moved away.","zh":"面對上升的海平面,島民們讓自己的文化延續下去,但許多年輕人已經搬走了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"面對"},{"w":"lead by example","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to show others how to behave by doing it yourself","cn":"以身作則","s":"Our principal wanted to ______ ______ ______, so she started riding a bicycle to school every day.","zh":"我們校長想要以身作則,所以她開始每天騎腳踏車上學。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"以身作則"},{"w":"at the expense of","pos":"phr.","def":"causing harm or loss to something else","cn":"以…為代價","s":"The factory grew quickly ______ ______ ______ ______ the river, and now the water is too dirty for fish.","zh":"這家工廠的快速成長是以河川為代價,現在河水髒到魚都無法生存。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"以 為代價"}]};
